<pṛ0 17> ātmā vā ākāśa ityādiśruteḥ brahmaṇaḥ sakāśādākāśasya 
tadabhimānapuruṣasya cotpatteḥ ākāśābhimāninaḥ sadāśivasyāpi 
sṛjyakoṭiniviṣṭatvena paraśivaniyamyatvāt(,) 
paṃcakṛtyakaraṇamahāpāṃḍityāvabhāvāt tathā viśeṣitaṃ jaḍasya 
jīvasya ca viśvakartṛtāsaṃbhavāt sūtrānuktamapi 
saccidānaṃdākhyasvarūpalakṣaṇaṃ tātparyaviṣayīkṛtaṃ || 
