ṅārāyaṇādrudro jāyate iti śrutyanaṃtarapaṭhitatvācca tasmādādyasya 
brahmaṇaḥ janma yato bhavati tadbrahmetyetallakṣaṇaṃ 
nārāyaṇasyaivopapadyata iti prāpte brūmaḥ atharvaśikhāyāṃ kiṃ 
