dhyānaṃ viṣṇuḥ dhyātā rudraḥ dhyāyīteśānaṃ pradhyāyitavya iti 
śrutatvena 
mahopaniṣatprasiddhanārāyaṇatatraniṣedhakoṭipraviṣṭharudrayoratra 
