nāstītyabhiprāyeṇa svasamāptiṃ svayamevāha iti sphuṭataraṃ 
śrūyamāṇatvāt | 
mahopaniṣatprasiddhabrahmādiviśvakāraṇībhūtanārāyaṇasyāpi 
kāraṇībhūtaḥ śiva eko dhyeya ityavagamāt eko ha vai nārāyaṇa āsīditi 
atra āsītpadasya rohito lohitādāsīt śakterāsītparāśaraḥ 
itivadutpattisattāparatāvaśyaṃbhāvena lakṣaṇamupapannameva nanu atra 
nārāyaṇasyotpattiḥ dhyātṛrudrāpekṣayā varatvaṃ ca na śrūyate kiṃtu 
viṣṇoreva nārāyaṇasyānaṃtāvatārasadbhāvāt viṣṇoḥ 
tadavatāramūrtitvāt athavā ādityānāmahaṃ viṣṇuḥ iti gītitatvena 
tadaṃśībhūtatvāt tatparatopapatteḥ atratyeśānādiśabdānāṃ lakṣaṇayā 
nārāyaṇaparatvameva yuktamiti cenna(,) 
mukhyabrahmarudramadhyapaṭhitaviṣṇuśabdasyāvatārāṃśaparatvāsaṃbhavāt 
yatprāyaḥ śrūyate yacca tattādṛgavagamyata iti 
pūrvataṃtravārtikanyāyāt anyathāpi kiṃkāraṇaṃ brahmeti 
saṃdihyamānānāṃ brahmavādināṃ svato nirṇetumaśakyatvāt devīṃ 
dhyāyatāṃ tatprasādena jagatkāraṇībhūtaṃ brahma śiva eva iti nirṇīte 
śvetāśvatare yadā 

<pṛ0 19> tamastanna divā na rātrirna sanna cāsacchiva eva kevalaḥ | ajāta 
ityeva kaścidbhīruḥ prapadyate rudra yatte dakṣiṇaṃ mukhaṃ tena māṃ pāhi 
nityaṃ yadā carmavadākāśaṃ veṣṭayiṣyaṃti mānavāḥ | tadā 
śivamavijñāya duḥkhaśāṃtirbhaviṣyati iti śrutatvena sṛṣṭeḥ pūrvaṃ 
viśvopādānakāraṇībhūtaprakṛtyaparaparyāyājñānalakṣaṇatamomātrāvaśi
ṣṭakāle divārātrilakṣaṇasadasadvibhāgaśūnyatvaṃ pratipādya 
sadāśivasyaiva sthitiśravaṇena dvitīyasyāvasthānāsaṃbhavāt(,) 
tasyājātatvaśravaṇāt(,) 
jananamaraṇaparipīḍitamumukṣujanaprārthanīyatvaśravaṇāt(,) 
śivajñānasyaiva mokṣapradatvaśravaṇācca | tasyotpattivināśāsaṃbhavāt 
śahasrāṇi sahasraśo ye rudrā adhibhūmyāṃ ityādiśruteḥ 
tadavatārarūpānaṃtarudramūrtistadbhāvāt tatratyotpattivināśāvapi 
dikpālāṃtargateśānaparāveva syātām(,) tathāca sṛṣṭeḥ prāk 
dvayorapyavasthānāsaṃbhavāt viṣṇuritthā paramasya vidvān yato 
brahmannābhipāti trayaṃ iti śrutyaṃtare bṛhaditi viśeṣaṇasāmarthyāt 
mahāviṣṇorevotpattimatvaṃ 
paramātmavetṛtvamaśuddhamiśravilakṣaṇaśuddhaprapaṃcarūpaparaśivarājadhā
nīparipālakatvaṃ ca pratīyata iti tatratyāsītpadasya darśitadiśā 
utpattisattāparatāvaśyaṃbhāvena 
śivaśaṃbhvādyanekaśabdalakṣaṇaṃ kalpanāyāḥ aprāmāṇikatvāt 
kaivalyaśrutau umāsahāyaṃ parameśvaraṃ prabhuṃ trilocanaṃ nīlakaṇṭhaṃ 
praśāṃtaṃ || dhyātvā munirgacchati bhūtayoniṃ samastasākṣiṃ tamasaḥ 
parastāt | sa brahmā sa śivaḥ seṃdraḥ so'kṣaraḥ paramaḥ svarāṭ | sa eva 
viṣṇuḥ sa prāṇaḥ sa kālo'gniḥ sa caṃdramāḥ || yadbhūtaṃ yacca bhavyam 
ityuktvā jñātvā taṃ mṛtyumatyeti nānyaḥ paṃthā vimuktaye || iti 
śrutatvena itaraniṣedhapuraḥsaraṃ mumukṣūpāsyasya 
parameśvarasyomāsahāyatvatrilocanatvanīlakaṇṭhatvaśravaṇāt eṣāṃ 
śivaikāṃśikatvena kathaṃcidapi nārāyaṇaparatvāsaṃbhavācca || 
evaṃ sthite patyurasāmaṃjasyāt ityadhikaraṇe 
tāṃtrikapāśupatāṃgīkṛtakevalaviśvanimittakāraṇatayā nirākṛtatvāt | 
ata eva śabdādeva pramita ityadhikaraṇe aṃguṣṭhamātraḥ puruṣo madhya 
ātmani tiṣṭhati īśāno bhūtabhavyasya sa evādyaḥ sa uśvaḥ iti 
kaṭhavallīmaṃtrasya parichinnaparimāṇatvaliṃgena jīvaparatvamāśaṃkya 
bhūtabhavyasyetyupapade satyapyevakāreṇa

<pṛ0 20> bhūtabhavyapadārtheśitṛtvaliṃgaṃ parityajya 
śabdāditīśānaśabdādbrahmaparatāyā aṃgīkṛtatvāt || 
kiṃca atra carācaragrahaṇāt ityadhikaraṇe kaṭhavallīdvitīyavalyāṃ yasya 
brahmakṣatra ubhe bhavata odanaḥ mṛtyuryasyaupasecanaṃ ka ityāveda sa iti 
śrutasya maṃtrasya jīvāgniparatvamāśaṃkya dvayorapi tayormṛtyugrastatvāt 
mṛtyuryasyopasecanamityuktatvena carācaraprapaṃcasaṃhārakartṛtvāvagamāt 
maṃtro'yamīśvarapara iti nirṇītatvena 
jagatsaṃhārakatvamīśvaralakṣaṇamityaṃgī kṛ tatvāt saṃhārakartā śiva 
iti prasiddhatvāt evaṃ ca patyuḥ paśupateḥ 
pāśupatāṃgīkṛtakevalaviśvanimittakāraṇatvaṃ na saṃbhavati 
asāmaṃjasyāt svavyatiriktamṛdādyupādānakāraṇāṃtarasāpekṣakulālādivat 
svātmaunmukhyavigalanenānyatraunmukhyāt adṛṣṭādiparataṃtratāpattyā 
anīśvaratvaprasaṃgāditi na kopi virodhaḥ||
viśvādhiko rudro maharṣiriti śruterviśvādhikatvaśravaṇāt 
ekaikamaṃtradraṣṭṝṣyapekṣayā sakalamaṃtradraṣṭṛtvena maharṣitvāt ata 
eva brāhmaṇottamatvādbrāhmaṇairupāsanīyaḥ pādodakaprasādāvapi 
svīkaraṇīyau bhṛgvādiśāpasya 
viśvāṃtargataguṇirudratīrthaprasādaviṣayatvāt 
bhṛgvādestāvatparyaṃtabhāvanāsaṃbhavāt muktasthānatvāt ṅa sa 
punarāvartata iti śruteḥ alaṃ prāsaṃgikena viśvaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ harimiti 
śruteḥ viśvaṃ viṣṇurvaṣaṭkāra iti tannāmasahasrasmṛteśca 
viṣṇorviśvāṃtargatatvāt patiṃ viśvasyeti viśvapatitvaśruteḥ tasya 
svakāryarūpaviśvāpekṣayeti na virodhaḥ nārāyaṇaparaṃbrahmetyatra 
nārāyaṇātparaṃ brahmetyupapannatvāt anyatra nārāyaṇaḥ paraṃ brahmeti 
pāṭhe śupāṃsulugiti sūtreṇa paṃcamyāḥ svādeśasya kalpanīyatvāt 
sarvaṃ samaṃjasaṃ evaṃ sthite 
bhāviprapaṃcakāraṇībhūtanārāyaṇāvirbhāvabhittibhūtaṃ paraśivākhyaṃ 
vastu jagadudayādibījaṃ brahmeti rāddhāṃtaḥ || 
nanu etāvatārthaprapaṃcakāraṇaṃ brahmetyuktaṃ bhavati 
śabdaprapaṃcakāraṇatvenoktaṃ tatkiṃ brahmavannityaṃ vetyāśaṃkyāha 
śāstrayonitvāt asya mahato'nubhūtasya niśvasitametat ṛgvedo yajurvedaḥ 
sāmavedo'tharvāṃgirasa iti viṣayavākyaṃ atra brahma vedaṃ na karoti 
karotīti saṃdehaḥ na karoti | vedasya nityatvāt(,) ṅīrūpanityayā vāceti 
śrūyamāṇatvāt viṣayavākye'pi vedasya 
brahmaṇo'prayatnasiddhaniśvasitarūpatāvagamāt anādinidhanā 

<pṛ0 21> nityā vāgutsṛṣṭā svayaṃbhuvā || ādau vedamayīṃ vidyāṃ yataḥ 
sarvāḥ pravattayaḥ | iti smṛteśceti pūrvaḥ pakṣaḥ atrābhidhīyate brahma 
vedasya kartṛ bhavitumarhati niśvasitanyāyenāprayatnotpattyavagamāt 
tasmādyajñātsarvahutaḥ ṛcaḥ sāmāni jajñire iti sarvayajñahūyamānāt 
yajñaśabdavācyānmaheśvarādatispaṣṭameva vedotpattiśravaṇācca 
niśvasitanyāyenāprayatnotpattyaiva arthaṃ budhvā viracitaiḥ 
kālidāsaprabhṛtivākyaiḥ vailakṣaṇyādapauruṣeyatvaṃ pratisargaṃ 
pūrvasāmyenotpatteḥ pravāharūpeṇa nityatvāsaṃbhavāditi rāddhāṃtaḥ atra 
sarvaviśvavyavasthāprakāśakavedakartṛtvanirūpaṇena brahmaṇaḥ 
sarvajñatvamuktaṃ bhavati | pūrvasūtre sarvakartṛtvaṃ nirūpitamiti 
maṃtavyaṃ | athavā(,) nanvevaṃvidhalakṣaṇopalakṣite brahmaṇi kiṃ 
pramāṇamityākāṃkṣāyāmāha śāstrayonitvāt tatra (tatrakaṃ 
tvaupaniṣadaṃ iti pāṭhāntaram) taṃ caupaniṣadaṃ puruṣaṃ sṛjāmīti 
viṣayavākyaṃ | atra brahmaṇaḥ pratyakṣādipramāṇagamyatvamasti vā naveti 
saṃdehaḥ ghaṭādivatsiddhavastutvānmānāṃtaragamyatvamastīti pūrvaḥ 
pakṣaḥ rūparasādyabhāvāt(,) neṃdriyayogyatā(,) nāpyaṃtaḥkaraṇagocaratvaṃ 
sukhaduḥkhādivajjaḍatvaprasaṃgāt(,) na ca sukhāderaṃtaḥkaraṇā(-)     
vacchinnacaitanyavedyatvājjaḍatvaṃ yuktaṃ(,) 
ātmanastvaṃtaḥkaraṇamātragocaratvānna jaḍatvamiti vācyaṃ(,) 
aṃtaḥkaraṇasya jaḍatvena vedakatvaṃ na saṃbhavatītyabhiprāyeṇaiva kila 
ghaṭasukhāderaṃtaḥkaraṇavṛttyavacchinnacaitanyavedyatvamaṃgīkṛtaṃ | evaṃ 
prakṛtepyaṃtaḥkaraṇasya jaḍatvena vedakatvāsaṃbhavāt(,) 
tadvṛttyavacchinnacaitanyavedyatāyā aṃgīkaraṇīyatvena 
jaḍatāpatteranivāryatvāt(,) nāpyanumānaṃ tasya 
pratyakṣamūlatvenātiparicchinnamaheśvaraprakāśanāpāṭavatvāt | anyathā 
tasya tadaṃtargatatayā bhāsamānatvena paricchinnatvaprasaṃgāt(,) 
tadanaṃtargatatve sati tatprakāśyatvāsaṃbhavāt tadbāhyatvāt | nanu 
śabdaliṃgenākāśānumānavatsaṃbhavatīti vācyaṃ(,) ākāśasyāpi janyatvena 
paricchinnatvāt tasya tatkarmatvena tadekarūpatvāt(,) anyathā jalādivat 
tattaddharmatvaprasaṃgāt(,) anumitirviśiṣṭaniṣṭhatvena 
brahmasvabhāvatvāsaṃbhavāt | evaṃ śābdajñānaviṣayatvamapi na saṃbhavati 
paricchinnatvāt svātiriktasaṃvidaṃtaravedyatvena 
ghaṭādivajjaḍatvaprasaṃgāt vijñātāramaketaṃ kena vijānīyāditi 
śrutiśceti ceditthamālocanīyaṃ | 

<pṛ0 22> vedasya tvaprayatnasiddhamāheśvarīyaniśvasitarūpatāvagamena yo 
brahmāṇaṃ vidadhāti pūrvaṃ yo vai vedāṃśca prahiṇoti tasmai iti śruteḥ 
brahmāṇaṃ prati vedānāṃ 
śabdajālamupadeṣṭurmaheśvarasyoktervivakṣādhīnatvāt icchāyāḥ 
saviṣayatvāt catvāri vākparimitāpadāni tāni vidurbrāhmaṇā ye 
manīṣiṇaḥ guhātrīṇi nihitāneṃgayaṃti turīyaṃ vāco manuṣyā 
vadaṃtīti śruteḥ 
aṃkurāyamāṇāṃkuritapallavitaphalitalakṣaṇasūkṣmāpaśyaṃtīmadhyamāvaik
haryaparaparyāyāraṃbhavivakṣādhyavasāyoktirūpeṇa 
svavimarśarūpatāvagamāt | ataḥ svānatiriktatvāt 
anadhigatayatkiṃcittanmāhātmyaprakāśanakṣamatvāt(,) 
vedaikapramāṇagamyamahadaiśvaryaṃ brahmeti rāddhāṃtaḥ ||
evaṃca śāstrasya vedāgamādiśabdapramāṇasya yonitvāt 
tanmāhātmyaprakāśanakṣamatvāt iti sūtrārthaḥ | nanu vedāṃtānāṃ 
brahmaparatvaṃ na saṃbhavati | anuṣṭhānopayogitvena niṣprayojanatvāt 
kartṛdevatāsādhanaparatve anuṣṭhānopayogitvena sārthakyāt(,) karmaśeṣa eva 
śabdārthalakṣaṇaprapaṃcasya cidvijātīyatvena 
brahmopādānakatvāsaṃbhavāduktalakṣaṇaṃ ca na saṃbhavatītyāśaṃkyāha(,) 
tattu samanvayāt tattu samanvayāditi vicchedaḥ tuśabdaḥ 
pūrvapakṣanirāsārthaḥ atra sadeva sommedamagra āsīdityārabhya sa ātmā 
tattvamasi śvetaketo ityaṃtaṃ viṣayavākyaṃ vedāṃtāḥ karmaparā vā 
brahmaparā veti saṃdehaḥ yajamānasya 
duḥkhāṃtarāyādyasaṃbhinnasukhalakṣaṇasvargaṃ prati jyotiṣṭomena 
svargakāmo yajeta ityādivākyaiḥ karmaiva vidhīyate(,) 
tajjanyayājamānaniṣṭhāpūrvavaśādeva tatsādhanībhūtapadārthotpattiḥ 
dehāṃtarakālāṃtarabhāvisvargaśca saṃbhavati | evaṃca vedāṃteṣu 
jīvapratipādakavākyāni kartṛyajamānaparāṇi(,) brahmapratipādakavākyāni 
devatāparāṇi(,) sṛṣṭipratipādakavākyāni dravyādisādhanaparāṇi(,) 
evamaṃgīkāre vedāṃtānāmanuṣṭhānopayogitvena sārthakyaṃ brahmaparatve 
tadabhāvādvaiyyarthyaṃ syāt | ataḥ kartṛdevatāsādhanaparatvena karmaśeṣā 
eva na brahmaparā iti   prāpte brūmaḥ ||
vedāṃtānāṃ bhinnaprakaraṇapaṭhitatvena karmaśeṣatvaṃ na saṃbhavati 
upakramopasaṃhārāvabhyāso'pūrvatāphalam | arthavādopapattī ca liṃgaṃ 
tātparyanirṇaye iti tātparyaniścayahetukaliṃgaṣaṭkena brahmaparatvāt | 
tathāhi śadeva somyedamagra āsīdityupakramaḥ etadātmyamidaṃ sarvaṃ 
tatsatyaṃ sa ātmā tattvamasi ityupasaṃhāraḥ anayorbrahmaviṣayatvenaikaṃ 
liṃgam

<pṛ0 23> asakṛttattvamasi ityabhyāsaḥ 
mānāṃtaragamyamahadaiśvaryamapūrvatvaṃ yenāśrutaṃ śrutaṃ bhavati 
amataṃ matamavijñātaṃ vijñātaṃ ityādyekavijñāne sarvavijñānaṃ phalaṃ 
| yathā mṛttikāyāṃ jñātāyāṃ ghaṭaśarāvādikaṃ 
tatkāryatvāttadabhinnamiti vijñātaṃ bhavati(,) tathaivetyarthaḥ 
sṛṣṭisthitilayapraveśaniyamasthānāni paṃcārthavādāḥ 
mṛdādidṛṣṭāṃtā upapattayaḥ etairliṃgairbrahmaparatvāt | 
nacānuṣṭhānamaṃtareṇa prayojanābhāvaḥ dehādyahaṃtānimajjanadvārā 
pūrṇāhaṃbhāvonmajjanarūpamahāphalasya saṃbhavāt | nanvevaṃ 
vedāṃtānāṃ brahmaparatve'pi te brahmaṇyeva na paryavasyaṃti kiṃtu śatyaṃ 
jñānamanaṃtaṃ brahmeti pārokṣyeṇa brahmatattvaṃ pratipādya 
paścādaparokṣaṃ vidadhati | evaṃ sati vedāṃtānāṃ śāsanāt 
śāstratvamupapadyate anadhigatārthagaṃtṛtvāt | kiṃtu śrotavya iti 
śābdajñānātmakaṃ śravaṇaṃ vidhāyānaṃtaraṃ maṃtavyo 
nidhidhyāsitavya iti anubhavajñānātmakaṃ vidhīyate | tasmādvedāṃtāḥ 
pratipattividhāyakā iti cenna(,) kartumakartumanyathākartumaśakyatvena 
apuruṣārthatvāt(,) pratipattividhirna saṃbhavatyeva anuṣṭheyaśāsanādeva 
śāstratvaṃ nānyatheti niyamo nāsti | siddhavastusādhanenāpi tadupapatteḥ na 
ca śābdajñānena jñāte         paścādanubhavātmakaṃ mananādikaṃ 
vidhīyata iti vaktuṃ yuktaṃ(,) daśamastvamasītivat 
śabdasyaivāparokṣajñānajanakatvena śābdabodhātpuraiva 
asaṃbhāvanādinivṛttaye kartṛvyāpārarūpamananādervidhānāt(,) 
pramāṇānāṃ mohāpasaraṇamātraprayojanatvāt ghaṭo'yamagrataḥ 
pratyakṣatvādityādau tathānubhūyamānatvāt | atra ghaṭo na kriyate 
siddhatvāt(,) na jñāpyate pratyakṣeṇaiva jñāpyamānatvāt(,) 
kiṃtvagrakatvasādhanenāgraka iti moho'panīyata iti | evaṃ dhūmaliṃgena 
vahnimatvasādhanena vahnimatvarūpamoho'pasāryata iti vedāṃtāḥ brahmaṇyeva 
paryavasitāḥ ata aitadātmyamidaṃ sarvaṃ tatsatyamiti śrutatvena san 
ghaṭaḥ san paṭa ityādirūpeṇa sarvatra sāmānyādiṣu sattā jaḍe 
vilakṣaṇasvarūpasattānuvṛttidarśanena 
satkāryatvāduktalakṣaṇamapyupapatteḥ jaḍasya 
svataḥsiddhasattānuvṛttyasaṃbhavāt(,) svataṃtratāpatteḥ 
parataḥsiddhasattānuvṛttyasaṃbhavaprakārasya darśitatvāt(,) 
sacciddhanatvamakāmenāpyaṃgīkaraṇīyamiti karmaṇo 
jaḍatvenādṛṣṭotpādanodyamaśūnyatvāt(,) adṛṣṭasyāpi jaḍatvena 
svargatatsādhanībhūtadravyotpādanodyamaśūnyatvāt | 
sarvaprapaṃcasattārūpasvatantra svaprakāśabrahmaiva 
sarvavedāṃtapratipādyamiti siddhāṃtaḥ || evaṃ sati tātparya(-)

<pṛ0 24> niścayahetukaliṃgaṣaṭkena vedāṃtānāṃ brahmaṇi samanvayāt 
tadbrahma uktalakṣaṇapramāṇagamyamahadaiśvaryamiti bhāvaḥ 
nanu asaṃgo hyayaṃ puruṣa itiśruteḥ brahmaṇo viśvakāraṇatvaṃ na 
saṃbhavatyeva(,) kiṃtu vedāṃteṣu kāraṇavākyāni pradhānaparāṇyeva(,) tathā 
śrūyamāṇatvādityāśaṃkyāha īkṣaternāśabdaṃ īkṣateḥ na aśabdaṃ iti 
vicchedaḥ chāṃdogye ṣaṣṭhādhyāye śadeva somyedamagra 
āsīdekamevādvitīyaṃ brahma iti prastutya tadaikṣata bahusyāṃ 
prajāyeyeti tattejo'sṛjateti śrūyate | idaṃ viṣayavākyaṃ(,) atra 
tacchabdavācyaṃ viśvakāraṇaṃ pradhānaṃ vā brahma veti saṃdehaḥ atra 
sāṃkhyā vadaṃti tacchabdavācyaṃ sarvajagatkāraṇaṃ pradhānameva 
ajāmekāṃ lohitaśuklakṛṣṇāṃ bahvīṃ prajā janayaṃtīṃ sarūpāṃ iti 
śrūyamāṇatvāt tasya satvaguṇayuktatvāt pariṇamanakriyāsvabhāvatvācca 
jñānakriyāśaktyorapi saṃbhavāt | brahmaṇo nirviśeṣatvena 
tadasaṃbhavāditi prāpte brūmaḥ tadaikṣatetyatra īkṣitṛtvaśravaṇāt(,) 
pradhānasya jaḍatvena tadasaṃbhavāt(,) tacchabdavācyaṃ cetanaṃ brahmaiva(,) 
tasya niḥsaṃgatvaṃ nirguṇatvaṃ ca 
naiyyāyikāṃgīkṛtasvavyatiriktaguṇasaṃgarāhityāt(,) 
svarūpānatiriktajñānakriyayoraṃgīkaraṇīyatvāt | anyathā 
jaḍatvaprasaṃgāt | iṣṭāpattau puruṣasya prakṛtiprerakatvāsaṃbhavena 
viśvotpattireva na syāt prakṛterjaḍatvena prerakamaṃtareṇa 
kāryotpādanākṣamatvāt | na ca teja āpa aikṣaṃta itivadgauṇamīkṣaṇaṃ 
pradhānasya saṃbhavatīti vācyaṃ haṃtā'hamimāstisro devatā anena 
jīvenātmanānupraviśya nāmarūpe vyākaravāṇi iti madhye 
tvastitādyaparityaktanāmarūpavyākartrī viśvakāraṇadevatā 
svavācakenātmaśabdena cetanajīvaṃ vyupadiśatīti upasaṃhāre śa ātmā 
tattvamasi śvetaketo iti śiṣyaṃ prati jagatkāraṇatādātmyaṃ 
guruṇopadiśyata iti gauṇekṣaṇasyāpyasaṃbhavāt |
nanvatra jīvenātmanānupraviśya nāmarūpe vyākaravāṇīti śrutatvāt 
jīvasya viśvakāraṇatāvagamāt | kathaṃ viśvakāraṇatvaṃ 
brahmāsādhāraṇalakṣaṇaṃ bhavitumarhatīti cet na jīvaśabdasya 
jñānakriyāsvabhāvacetanaparatvāt jānatā kurvatā bhāvyaṃ jīvatā 
parayoginā | dṛkkriyāsadasadbhāvau heturaiśvaryajāḍyayoḥ || iti 
śivadṛṣṭismṛtatvācca jñānakriye vinā prapaṃcasya vyākartumaśakyatvāt | 
nanvevamapi jñānakriyāsvabhāvatvaṃ jīvasādhāraṇaṃ 

<pṛ0 25> bhavati puruṣatattvameva tacchabdavācyaṃ kiṃ na syāditi cenna | 
ātmāpyanīśaḥ sukhaduḥkhahetoḥ brahmaviṣṇurudreṃdrāste saṃprasūyaṃta 
itiśruteḥ brahmādīnāmapi bhūteṃdriyādibhistaulyena 
parataṃtrotpattiśravaṇena sukhaduḥkhādidūṣitatvena ca 
viśvakāraṇatvāsaṃbhavāt(,) kāryakoṭipraviṣṭatvāt 
tatkāraṇībhūtamaheśvarasya sarvaiśvaryasaṃpannaḥ sarveśvaraśceti 
sarvaiśvaryaśālitvasarveśvaraśabdavācyatvayoḥ śravaṇāt(,) 
prakṛtiniṣṭhasya puruṣasya sa ātmā tattvamasīti mokṣopadeśācca(,) 
nātivyāptiḥ| gomayādervṛścikādyutpattidarśanāt(,) 
ūrṇanābhidṛṣṭāṃtācca(,) brahmaṇaḥ svataṃtratvāt na 
svavyatiriktakāraṇāṃtarasahāyāpekṣā | anyathā kriyāśaktivihīnatve sati 
brahmaṇaḥ śuktirajatādivadalīkatvamāpatediti 
svataṃtrasvaprakāśatāśaktiparibṛṃhitaṃ brahmaiva tacchabdavācyamiti 
rāddhāṃtaḥ ||
evaṃ ca aśabdaṃ vaktṛtvaśūnyaṃ pradhānaṃ na viśvakāraṇaṃ 
bhavitumarhati | īkṣateḥ īkṣitṛtvaśravaṇāditi sūtrārthaḥ 
asminnadhikaraṇe vakṣyamāṇāvirodhādhyāyārthaḥ sarvo'pi saṃgṛhītaḥ | 
tanniṣṭhasya mokṣopadeśādityutsūtritatvāt phalādhyāyārthaśca 
samanvayasūtre samanvayādhyāyārthaḥ jijñāsāsūtre sādhanādhyāyārthaḥ 
sarvo'pi saṃgṛhītaḥ ityuttamādhikāriṇaṃ prati īkṣatyaṃtaiva brahmavidyā 
| madhyamādhikāriṇaṃ prati paṃcapādikā | adhamādhikāriṇaṃ prati 
avaśiṣṭaśāstraṃ pravṛttamiti maṃtavyaṃ | atra 
praṇavārthasārabhūtasakalasādhāraṇasadrūpātmatvajaḍotkṛṣṭatvajīvavila
kṣaṇamahadaiśvaryasaṃpannatārūpasaccidānandākhyasvarūpalakṣaṇameva 
prakaṭīkṛtamiti sūkṣmadṛśā vilokanīyam ||
agre tadananyatvamāraṃbhaṇaśabdādibhyaḥ|| ātmakṛteḥ pariṇāmāt 
kṛtsnaprasaktirniravayavatvaśabdakopo vā || ātmani caivaṃ vicitrāśca hi || 
māyāmātraṃ tu kārtsnenānabhivyaktasvarūpatvāt netaro'nupapatteḥ || 
ityādisūtraiḥ jaḍājaḍaprapaṃcasya kartṛ maheśvarābhinnatvameva 
viśeṣataḥ prakaṭīkriyate(,) atra māyāśabdena māyāṃ tu prakṛtiṃ 
vidyānmāyinaṃ tu maheśvarama || iti śruteḥ svābhāvikaprakṛtiḥ kathyate 
sā ca prakṛṣṭākṛtiriti vyutpattyā aghaṭanaghaṭanāpaṭutarā 
kartṛsvabhāvabhūtā kriyāśaktiḥ kathyate | tasmādiyameva vidyā vidyā na 
bhavatītyavidyā mithyābhūteti na virodhaḥ tasyāvayavabhūtena 
vyāptametaccarācaram ityagre śravaṇāt evaṃ bhūtamāyino 

<pṛ0 26> maheśvarasyāvayavabhūtena aṃśāvatārarūpeṇa nārāyaṇena 
jagatsarvaṃ vyāptamityavagamāt śhrotraṃ ca śrotavyaṃ ca nārāyaṇa 
ityādiśruteśca sāpekṣayā bhāviviśvopādānakāraṇaṃ nārāyaṇa eveti 
tasya vimarśāṃśatvamavagaṃtavyam || 
raso'hamapsu kauṃteya prabhā'smi śaśisūryayoḥ |
praṇavaḥ sarvavedeṣu śabdaḥ khe pauruṣaṃ nṛṣu || 
iti gītatvācca | evaṃsthite brahmaṇaḥ tāvat dṛkkriyāsvabhāvatvena 
cetanatvāt ataścaitanyamātmeti śivenāpi sūtritatvāt(,) 
brahmaśivasūtrayorekārthaviśrāṃtatvena virodhābhāvāt | śāstraikyaṃ 
vimarśanīyaṃ || 
atha viśabdenocyate vidyā śivajīvaikyabodhikā || tasyāṃ ramaṃte ye śaivā 
vīraśaivāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || iti tatsiddhāṃtavacanāt tenāpi 
virodhābhāvāt tadaikyaṃ vimarśanīyaṃ | tatsiddhāṃtasya 
liṃgāṃgasāmarasyapratipādakatvāt(,) tathāhi tadāgameṣu || ghanaliṃgaṃ 
mahābhāsaṃ saccidānaṃdalakṣaṇaṃ || niṣkalaṃ niṣkriyaṃ śāṃtaṃ 
svataṃtra svaprakāśi tat || sarveṣāṃ sthānabhūtatvāllayabhūtatvatastathā 
|| tattvānāṃ mahadādīnāṃ sthalamityabhidhīyate || sthāṇau 
sarvāśraye'naṃte saccidānaṃdarūpiṇi || yasmin brahmaṇi līyeta 
prapaṃcastatsthalaṃ smṛtam || svaśaktikṣobhamātreṇa sthalaṃ tat dvividhaṃ 
bhavet || ekaṃ liṃgasthalaṃ proktamanyadaṃgasthalaṃ smṛtam || liṃgasthalaṃ 
tridhā jñeyaṃ bhāvaprāṇeṣṭabhedataḥ || prathamaṃ bhāvaliṃgaṃ syāt 
dvitīyaṃ prāṇaliṃgakam || tṛtīyamiṣṭaliṃgaṃ syādityevaṃ trividhaṃ 
smṛtam || ekamekaṃ sthalaṃ bhūyo dvividhaṃ dvividhaṃ bhavet || mahāliṃgaṃ 
prasādākhyaṃ bhāvaliṃgavibhāgajaṃ || prāṇaliṃgājjaṃgamākhyaṃ 
śivaliṃgaṃ ca bhidyate || guruliṃgaṃ tathācāraliṃgamiṣṭavibhāgataḥ || 
aṃgasthalaṃ tathā proktamācāryaiḥ sūkṣmadarśibhiḥ || yogāṃgaṃ 
prathamaṃ proktaṃ bhogāṃgaṃ ca dvitīyakam || tyāgāṃgaṃ ca tṛtīyaṃ 
syādityevaṃ trividhaṃ  smṛtam || yogāṃgamaikyaṃ śaraṇaṃ 
sthalamityubhayaṃ bhavet || prāṇaliṃgi prasādīti dvayaṃ bhogāṃgamiṣyate 
|| māheśvarasthalaṃ bhaktasthalamityubhayaṃ sthalaṃ || tyāgāṃgaṃ 
bhavatītyeva procyate tattvadarśibhiḥ || iti ayaṃ bhāvaḥ 
sakalaprapaṃcasṛṣṭisthitilayabhittisthānabhūtaṃ vastu 
sthalaśabdenābhidhīyate || 
tadvastūktalakṣaṇamūlapraṇavaprakāśaikavigrahaṃ paraśivatattvaṃ 
mānāṃtaranirapekṣabhāsamānatvāt(,) svaprakāśaṃ 
kāraṇāṃtaranirapekṣakurvāṇatvāt(,) 

<pṛ0 27> svataṃtraṃ ata evānyanirapekṣavartamānaṃ ata 
evākarmakākramasvasaṃvedanalakṣaṇasaccidānaṃdasphuraṇamayaṃ 
evaṃvidhaparipūrṇāhaṃtātmakaparamaśivasya pūjyapūjakalīlāyāṃ 
nistaraṃgasamudre taraṃgotpatteḥ prāk laharīva svātmani 
īṣaccalanamutpadyate | 
taccalanenānyonyasamarasībhūtasvataṃtrasvaprakāśatāṃśamātre 
tūttamakartṛtāmātraviyogāt(,) nyūnādhikabhāvena sa dvidhā bhidyate | 
tatrādhikabhāvāpannasvaprakāśatāyāṃ pratisphuraṇagatyā 
praviṣṭamūlapraṇavarūpaśivacaitanyameva liṃgatattvaṃ bhavati | 
nyūnībhūtasvaprakāśatāyāṃ tathaiva praviṣṭaśivacaitanyamevāṃgatattvaṃ 
bhavati |
tatra liṃgatattvaṃ tu krameṇa 
saccidānaṃdapratiphalanakalanātmakabhāvaliṃgamiti(,) prāṇaliṃgamiti(,) 
iṣṭaliṃgamiti(,) trividhaṃ bhavati | punaridaṃ liṃgatrayaṃ pratyekaṃ 
dvividhaṃ bhavati | tatra bhāvaliṃgaṃ hi mahāliṃgaṃ prasādaliṃgamiti 
dvividhaṃ bhavati prāṇaliṃgaṃ tu jaṃgamaliṃgaṃ śivaliṃgamiti dvividhaṃ 
bhavati | iṣṭaliṃgaṃ tu guruliṃgaṃ ācāraliṃgamiti dvividhaṃ bhavati | 
evaṃ liṃgasthalaṃ ṣaḍvidhaṃ bhavati | 
sā svataṃtrasvaprakāśatāśaktireva kramādeṣu liṃgeṣu 
sūkṣmakāryakaraṇaprapaṃcopādānakāraṇībhūtacicchaktyaparaparyāyapraṇava
rūpaśāṃtyatītottarākhyakaleti(,) 
ānaṃdarūpaparāśaktyaparaparyāyayakāramayaśāṃtyatītakaleti(,) 
aunmukhyalakṣaṇādiśaktyaparaparyāyavākārarūpaśāṃtikaleti(,) 
sūkṣmakriyālakṣaṇecchāśaktyaparaparyāyaśikārarūpavidyākaleti(,) 
bahirmukhījñānaśaktyaparaparyāyamakāramayapratiṣṭhākaleti(,) 
sthūlodyamakriyāśaktyaparaparyāyanakārarūpanivṛttikaleti(,) ṣaḍrūpatāmagam
at || evaṃ ca mahāliṃgaṃ tāvat 
sarvapadārthānusaṃdhānalakṣaṇahṛdayarūpatvāt(,) 
śuddhānusaṃdhātṛrūpagopyamukhamityucyate | prasādādiliṃgapaṃcakaṃ tu 
krameṇa 
śabdādipratiniyatapadārthānusaṃdhātṛrūpeśānatatpuruṣāghoravāmasadyojā
tākhyaprakaṭapaṃcamukhamityucyate | evaṃ vidhaliṃgatattvasya 
sāgarataraṃgabhaṃginyāyenābhedaparyavasāyibhedapradhānalakṣaṇaśuddhānusa
ṃdhātṛrūpatvenānugrahahetutvādupāsyamityucyate | evamaṃgatattvaṃ ca 
trividhaṃ | 
svātmaguruliṃgajaṃgamānāmaikyayogānusaṃdhānalakṣaṇayogāṃgamiti 
tadarpitaprasādaparamopādeyasvīkārasukhapariṇamanalakṣaṇabhogāṃgamiti 
guruliṃgajaṃgameṣvavaṃcanīyaparityajanīyatanumanodhanarūpatyāgāṃgamiti | 
idaṃ ca pratyekaṃ dvividhaṃ bhavati | yogāṃgaṃ tu aikyaṃ śaraṇamiti 
bhidyate | bhogāṃgaṃ

<pṛ0 28> tu prāṇaliṃgi prasādīti bhidyate | tyāgāṃgaṃ tu māheśvaraṃ 
bhaktasthalamiti bhidyate | evaṃ ṣaḍvidhāṃgaprakāśānāṃ 
nyūnībhāvamāpannā sā śaktireva 
samarasabhaktirityānaṃdabhaktirityanubhavabhaktirityavadhānabhaktiriti(,) 
naiṣṭhikābhaktiriti(,) śraddhābhaktiriti(,) ṣaḍvidhabhaktirūpatāṃ 
bhāvajñānamanobuddhyahaṃkāracittalakṣaṇāṃtaḥkaraṇaṣaṭkatāṃ 
śrotrādijñāneṃdriyarūpatāṃ 
śabdāditadviṣayatṛptilakṣaṇaṣaṭpadārthatāṃ 
tadvācakaṣaḍakṣarīrūpatāṃ 
kriyāsādhanībhūtavāgādikarmaiṃdriyarūpatāṃ 
sūkṣmarūpākāśādibhūtapaṃcakasamaṣṭirūpatāṃ 
sadbhāvasujñānasumanonirahaṃkārasubuddhisucittākhyaṣaṭkararūpatāṃ ca 
prāpyāṃgamabhavat | evaṃvidhāṃgatattvasya 
maheśvarīyalīlāśaktiparikalpitasaṃkucitacidādiśaktisvabhāvatvepi 
sūkṣmarūpamānasavyomādyupādhisaṃvalitatvenordhvasṛṣṭirūpavibhāganibandh
anabhedapradhānalakṣaṇaśuddhavidyāpramātṛrūpatvādupāsakamityucyate | 
evaṃ ca liṃgatattvasya śaraṇatattvamaṃgaṃ(,) śaraṇasya liṃgaṃ prāṇaḥ(,) 
anayorbījavṛkṣanyāyena anyonyasāmarasyameva | evamanāditaḥ śaraṇa eva 
liṃgaṃ liṃgameva śaraṇa iti nūnaṃ | athaivaṃvidhaśaraṇasya 
svavimarśalakṣaṇagurukaṭākṣasaṃprāptasvātmapratyabhijñānaśālitvāt(,) 
etanmana eva praṇavarūpamahāliṃgaṃ 
bāhyeṃdriyalakṣaṇaśrotrādyekaikeṃdriyaviṣayaśabdādisakalapadārthagrahaṇ
asādhanatvenāṃtarmukhatvāt(,) 
nādasunādamahānādarūpadeśikavākyaśāstravivakṣādhyavasāyoktirūpapaśya
ṃtyādikrameṇānugrahātmakaprasādahetutvāt(,) śabdagrahaṇasādhanaśrotrameva 
yakārarūpaprasādaliṃgaṃ carajaṃgamayoḥ paryāyatvāt(,) tasya tvak 
sarvāṃgaṃ vyāptā satī tatra śītādisparśasādhanatvāt | 
vākāramayajaṃgamaliṃgaṃ mahāprakāśa eva netragolakaṃ praviṣṭaḥ san 
sakalarūpapadārthaprakāśanasādhanatvāt netrameva śikāramayaśivaliṃgaṃ 
gurormaṃtramūrtitvāt ṣaḍakṣarīmaṃtra eva madhurāmlādiṣaḍrasarūpatāṃ 
prāpta iti tādṛṅmaṃtroccāraṇarasāsvādanasādhanatvāt | jihvaiva 
makāramayaguruliṃgaṃ īḍāpiṃgalākhyanāḍīdvārā 
prāṇavāyusaṃcārāśrayatvāt 
satkarmācaraṇahetubhūtadehaśuddhirūparecakādikramotpannaprāṇāyāmācaraṇa
sādhanatvācca(,) ghrāṇameva nakāramayamācāraliṃgamiti bhaṇyate | evaṃ 
liṃgalakṣaṇamavagaṃtavyaṃ || 
atha guruliṃgajaṃgamānāmaikyadhiyā bhasmarudrākṣādiśivalāṃkachaneṣu 
śivaśaraṇeṣu ca prītilakṣaṇabhaktimāneva bhaktaḥ ||

<pṛ0 29> mahātmā jñānapūrvastu sudṛḍhaḥ sarvato'dhikaḥ ||
sneho bhaktiriti proktastayā muktirna cānyathā || 
iti śaṃkarasaṃhitokteḥ(,) śiva eva śrīguruliṃgajaṃgamātmaka iti 
niṣṭhāvāneva maheśvaraḥ(,) 
guruliṃgajaṃgamapādodakaprasādabhūtirudrākṣamaṃtralakṣaṇāṣṭāvaraṇait
adaṃtargatādyapaṃcavidhavartanapaṃcācāreṣu vismṛtiśūnyatvena 
sāvadhānavāneva prasādī | vyādhyādau saṃprāpte(,) 
pādodakaprasādavyatirekeṇa liṃgārpitauṣadhaṃ cāyaṃ na svīkarotīti 
tābhyāṃ viśiṣṭaḥ liṃgameva prāṇaḥ prāṇa eva 
liṃgamityanusaṃdhānavāneva prāṇaliṃgī | tādṛśaprāṇaliṃgameva patiḥ 
svayameva satīti satīpatibhāvamāpannaḥ san satyāḥ satyaṃtaraṃ 
nāstītyanyasatīsaṃgaṃ parityajya svacicchaktisaṃmelanānaṃdabharitaḥ san 
nivṛttimārgamavalaṃbya bhaktijñānavairāgyasaṃpanna eva śaraṇa ityucyate | 
evaṃvidhasatīpatibhāvanivṛttyāvirbhāvanirābhāsaḥ san | vikalpavaimukhyena 
sarvaṃ śivātmakamiti vimṛśan śikhikarpūrayogavat 
aṃtarmukhamahāliṃgaikalolībhūta evaikyaḥ | ityaṃgasthalaṃ vimarśanīyaṃ | 
atra karpūrasya bhūtatvarūpatvāt(,) tasya paraṃparayā tejaḥkāryatvāt(,) 
kāryanāśasya kāraṇātmanā sthitirūpatvāt(,) na svarūpahāniriti 
śaṃkāvakāśaḥ | evaṃ ca bhaktādiṣaḍvidhaśivaśaraṇānāṃ 
ācārādiṣaḍvidhaliṃgānāṃ ca saṃbaṃdho vimarśanīyaḥ taduktaṃ bhavati 
||
ācāraliṃgaṃ ghrāṇākhyaṃ bhaktasthalasamāśrayaṃ ||
nivṛttikalayopetaṃ gaṃdhagrahaṇasādhanam || 
guruliṃgaṃ tu jihvākhyaṃ maheśasthalasaṃśrayaṃ || 
pratiṣṭhākalayopetaṃ rasagrahaṇasādhanam || 
śivaliṃgaṃ tu netrākhyaṃ prasādisthalasaṃśrayam || 
vidyākalāsamopetaṃ rūpagrahaṇasādhanam || 
tvagākhyaṃ jaṃgamaṃ liṃgaṃ prāṇaliṃgasthalāśrayam || 
śāṃtyākhyakalayopetaṃ sparśagrahaṇasādhanam || 
prasādaligaṃ śrotrākhyaṃ śaraṇasthalasaṃśrayam || 
śāṃtyatītakalopetaṃ śabdagrahaṇasādhanam || 
mānasaṃ tu mahāliṃgamaikyasthalasamāśrayam || 
śāṃtyatītottaropetaṃ sarvagrahaṇasādhanam || iti ||
atra mānasādīnāṃ karaṇarūpatve'pi ghrātṛtvādilakṣaṇacaitanyasya 
ghreyādipadārthasvīkārasādhanatvena tadekaniṣṭhatvāt(,) 
liṃgarūpatvavyapadeśaḥ| anyathā ghrāturghrāṇarasane 
vāggaṃdhagrahaṇasādhanaṃ syāditi tātparyaṃ | bhaktādi(-)

<pṛ0 30> lakṣaṇaṃ tu skāṃde śaṃkarasaṃhitāyāṃ śadācāraḥ śive 
bhaktirliṃge jaṃgama ekadhīḥ || 
lāṃchane śaraṇe bhaktirbhaktasthalamanuttamam || 
parastriyaṃ parārthaṃ ca varjito bhāvaśuddhimān || 
liṃganiṣṭhāniyuktātmā māheśvaramahāsthalam || 
liṃgārpitapadārthaṃ ca subhogī liṃga āhitaḥ || 
anarpitavivarjī ca prasādisthalamuttamaṃ || 
vāyau prāṇaguṇe liṃgaṃ liṃge prāṇaḥ samāhitaḥ || 
sukhaduḥkhobhayaṃ nāsti prāṇaliṃgisthalaṃ bhavet || 
patirliṃgaṃ satī cāhaṃ hṛdi yuktaḥ svayaṃ prabhuḥ || 
prāpaṃcikasukhaṃ nāsti śaraṇasthalamuttamam || 
ṣaḍūrmayaśca ṣaḍbhāvā nāsti cāṣṭavidhārcanam || 
nirbhāvo nijaliṃgaikyaḥ śikhikarpūrayogavat || 
iti atra śaraṇasya prāpaṃcikasukhaṃ nāstītyanena strīparigraho nahīti 
sūcitaṃ || evaṃ cātrāṃgasthalasya liṃgasthalāṃtargatatvāt(,) 
śāṃtyatītottarākhyakalopetamahāsādākhyamahāliṃgatattvamekaṃ | 
śiṣṭapaṃcaliṃgagatakalāpaṃcakaṃ 
śivasādākhyāmūrtisādākhyamūrtisādākhyakarmasādākhyakartṛsādākhyarūp
asādākhyapaṃcakaṃ militvā liṃgatattvānyekādaśeti saṃketaḥ | evaṃ sati(,) 
niṣkalaghanaliṃgatattvasya mahāliṃgaṃ mānasākhyāṃtarmukhaṃ 
prasādādiliṃgapaṃcakaṃ bāhyamukhapaṃcakaṃ sādākhyapaṃcakaṃ tu 
īśānādyaparaparyāyanāmadheyapaṃcakamiti tātparyaṃ | atha punastasya 
maheśituḥ sthūlaprapaṃcanirmāṇalīlāyāṃ 
ācāraliṃganiṣṭhakriyāśaktyaparaparyāyanivṛttikalāvaśāt(,) 
ahaṃkārādibhūmyaṃtatrayoviṃśatitattvamūlakāraṇībhūtasatvarajastamoguṇa
atmakaprakṛtyaparaparyāyamāyātattvamutpannaṃ bhavati | tatra 
sātvikādiguṇapraviṣṭacaitanyameva rudraviṣṇubrahmākhyayā vyavahriyate | 
krameṇa vahnisūryasomāścaitadaṃtargatāḥ 
brahmakṣatravaiśyaśūdrākhyāścatvāro varṇāśca | cāturvarṇyaṃ mayā 
sṛṣṭaṃ guṇakarmavibhāgataḥ iti bhagavataiva bhāṣitatvāt(,) kathaṃ 
guṇatrayādvarṇacatuṣṭayotpattiriti nāśaṃkanīyaṃ | viśvādhiko rudro 
maharṣiḥ puruṣo vai rudraḥ sanmaho namaḥ iti śruteḥ 
śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśatvācca 
satvaguṇapraviṣṭacaitanyarūpamaharṣirudrāṃśībhūtabrāhmaṇotpattiḥ 
satvaguṇāt | rajoguṇasya miśritatvāt tadgatasatvāṃśatastu 
vaiṣṇavarājanyotpattiḥ | tadgatatamoṃ'śena brahmāṃśībhūtavaiśyotpattiḥ 
| tamoguṇādiṃdrāṃśībhūtaśūdrotpattiḥ| anye devāḥ saṃkarāḥ | uktaṃ 
ca parāśaropapurāṇe śaṃkarāḥ sarvadevāḥ syurvṛṣalaśca puraṃdaraḥ|| 
pitāmahastu vaiśyaḥ syāt kṣatriyaḥ paramo hariḥ || brāhmaṇo bhagavān 
rudraḥ sarveṣāmuttamottamaḥ || 

<pṛ0 31> brahmabhūtasya rudrasya brāhmaṇyaṃ naiva hetujam || iti nanu(?) 
purāṇeṣu sarvatra viṣṇuḥ sātvikaḥ rudrastāmasa iti 
smaryamāṇatvātkathamuktārthasiddhiriti cenna | viṣṇurudrayoḥ 
sātvikatāmasokteḥpālanasaṃhāropādhikṛtatvāta(,) svabhāvatastu 
viṣṇustāmasaḥ rudraḥ sātvika eva | taduktaṃ bhāgavata eva || śatvaṃ 
rajastama iti prakṛterguṇāḥ syuryuktaḥ paraḥ puruṣa eva ihāsya dhatte || 
sthityādayo hariviriṃciharetisaṃjñā iti ṅa te 
giritrākhilalokapālaviriṃcivaikuṇṭhasureṃdragamyam || jyotiḥ paraṃ yatra 
rajastamaśca satvaṃ na yadbrahma nirastabhedamiti || atra prathamaśloke 
kramālaṃkāreṇa viṣṇoḥ sātvikatvaṃ rudrasya tāmasatvaṃ ca 
pālanādyupādhikṛtamiti spaṣṭameva pratīyate | 
kālakūṭaviṣolbaṇaprastāve rudraṃ prati(,) na te giritreti brahmaproktavacane 
kramālaṃkāreṇa vaikuṃṭhasya tamoguṇatvaṃ sureṃdrāparaparyāyarudrasya 
sātvikatvaṃ ca svabhāvikaṃ pratīyate | śuklavarṇatvādrudrasya 
kṛṣṇavarṇatvādviṣṇoriti(,) asminnarthe skāṃdapurāṇe || śhauklyaṃ 
satvaguṇājjātaṃ rāgo jāto rajoguṇāt || kārṣṇyaṃ tamoguṇājjātamiti 
viṃdyātsamāsataḥ || yasya māyāgataṃ satvaṃ śarīraṃ syāttamoguṇaḥ || 
saṃhārāya     trimūrtīnāṃ sa rudraḥ syānna cāparaḥ || tathā yasya 
tamaḥ sākṣāccharīraṃ sātviko guṇaḥ || pālanāya trimūrtīnāṃ sa 
viṣṇuḥ syānnacāparaḥ iti smṛtatvācca | atra brahmādikīṭāṃtāḥ 
sakalāḥ trimalinaḥ viṣṇuḥ pralayākalo dvimalī pralaye kalāśūnyatvāt 
jñānī rudro hi vijñānākalaḥ kalāśūnyatvāt sadā jñānī saṃhārāya 
māyaikamalī | ūrdhvakoṭigatatyāgāṃgaprakāśastu 
kārmyaikamalavāsanāviśiṣṭatvānmaṃtraḥ bhogāṃgābhāsastu 
kārmamalavāsanākṣayaunmukhyarūpatvānmaṃtreśvaraḥ yogāṃgapratibhāsastu 
prāptakārmamalavāsanākṣayarūpatvānmaṃtramaheśvara iti bhaṇyate 
evamete ṣaḍvidhapramātaraḥ niṣkalaghanaliṃgaprakāśastu 
anutpannamalollāsapūrṇāhaṃsphuraṇamayīti vivekaḥ | 
atrānyonyābhāvalakṣaṇabhedapradhānarūpamāyākāryakoṭipraviṣṭamaṃgatatt
vaṃ paṃcaviṃśatisaṃkhyākamiti bodhyaṃ | atrāṃtaḥkaraṇatrayaṃ 
jñāneṃdriyapaṃcakaṃ ca satvakāryaṃ(,) karmaiṃdriyapaṃcakaṃ rājasaṃ(,) 
tanmātrapaṃcakaṃ bhūtapaṃcakaṃ ca tāmasamityavagaṃtavyaṃ ||
atra bahūnāṃ janmanāmaṃte jñānavānmāṃ prapadyata iti bhagavadukteḥ 
anekajanmārjitaśivapūjādisatkarmamahimnā iha janmani gurukaṭākṣava(-)

<pṛ0 32> śādevaṃvidhaṣaṭsthalabrahmajñānaṃ kaścideva labdhvā mukto 
bhavatīti nūnaṃ | athoktalakṣaṇaṣaṭsthalabrahmaviccharaṇasya 
gopyādisadyāṃtaṣaṇmukhasamuditajyotirbiṃdvardhacaṃdrakuṃḍaladaṃḍatāraka
akāraṣaḍakṣarāṇyeva ṣaḍbhūtāni bhūtvāṃ'gatāmabhajan | iti 
tadaṃge ṣaṭpraṇavarūpeṣṭaliṃgaṃ susthiramāse tatpīṭhe 
hyācāraliṃgaṃ(,) khaṃḍikāvaraṇe guruliṃgaṃ(,) vartule śivaliṃgaṃ(,) gomukhe 
jaṃgamaliṃgaṃ(,) yonisthāne prasādaliṃgaṃ(,) golake mahāliṃgaṃ(,) 
ityevaṃ ṣaḍvidhaliṃgānāṃ prakāśamānatvāt | tatra 
bhaktastāvadācāraliṃgasya kriyāśaktiyuktasya śraddhābhaktyā sucittahastena 
gaṃdhapadārthaṃ dhṛtvā nakāramaṃtramanusmaran ghrāṇeṃdriyamukhe samarpya 
tatprasādabhogī bhūtvā pariṇāmī bhavati | maheśvaro hi guruliṃgasya 
jñānaśaktiyuktasya naiṣṭhikābhaktyā subuddhihasteta rasapadārthaṃ dhṛtvā 
makāramaṃtramanusmaran rasaneṃdriyamukhe samarpya tatprasādaṃ svīkṛtya 
pariṇāmī bhavati | prasādī tu śivaliṃgasya icchāśaktiyuktasya 
sāvadhānabhaktyā nirahaṃkārahastena rūpapadārthaṃ parigṛhya 
śikāramaṃtramanusmaran netreṃdriyamukhe samarpya tatprasādabhogī bhūtvā 
pariṇāmī bhavati | prāṇaliṃgī tu aunmukhyaśaktiyuktasya jaṃgamaliṃgasya 
anubhāvabhaktyā sumanohastena sparśapadārthaṃ   dhṛtvā 
vākāramaṃtramanusmaran tvagiṃdriyamukhe samarpya tatprasādabhogī bhūtvā 
pariṇāmī bhavati | śaraṇastu parāśaktiyuktasya prasādaliṃgasya 
ānaṃdabhaktyā sujñānahastena śabdapadārthaṃ dhṛtvā 
yakāramaṃtramanusmaran śrotreṃdriyamukhe samarpya tatprasādaṃ bhuktvā 
pariṇāmī bhavati | aikyastu(,) cicchaktiyuktasya mahāliṃgasya samarasabhaktyā 
sadbhāvahastena tṛptipadārthaṃ dhṛtvā praṇavamaṃtramanusmaran manomukhe 
samarpya tatprasādatṛptaḥ san pariṇāmī bhavati | evaṃ samarpitavataḥ 
śaraṇasya jñapte brahmaṇi viśramitatvāt 
oṃkāro vadanaṃ devi namaḥkārau bhujadvayam || 
śikāro dehamadhyastu vāyakārau padadvayam || 
pīṭhaṃ pādādijānvaṃtamānābhermadhyamīritam || 
hṛdayāṃtaṃ vartulaṃ syātkaṃṭhāṃtaṃ gomukhaṃ tathā || 
bhrūmadhyāṃtaṃ liṃgakaṃṭho mastako liṃgamastakaḥ || 
iti vacanāt taccharīrasyāpi maṃtraliṃgarūpatvāt(,) ācaraṇīyaṃ kimapi 
nāstyeva | tathāpi(,) liṃgāṃgasāmarasyaprakāro vibhāvanīyaḥ || tathāhi || 
pṛthvī bhaktāṃgaṃ bhūtvā tatraiva līnā bhavati | ciddhṛtirūpatvāt vāri 
maheśvarāṃgaṃ bhūtvā tatraiva līnaṃ | cidāpyāyanarūpatvāt | tejaḥ 
prasādyaṃgaṃ bhūtvā tatraiva līnaṃ | cidujvalanarūpatvāt | vāyuḥ

<pṛ0 33> prāṇaliṃgyaṃgaṃ bhūtvā tatraiva līnaḥ 
svataṃtratālakṣaṇaspaṃdanarūpatvāt | vyoma śaraṇāṃgaṃ bhūtvā tatraiva 
līnaṃ cidvyāptirūpatvāt | vedyasaṃskārātmakabiṃdurhi aikyāṃgaṃ bhūtvā 
tatraiva līnaḥ| evaṃ bhaktasyācāraliṃgāṃgatvāt(,) sa tatraiva līnaḥ| 
guruliṃgāṃgatvāt(,) maheśvarasya sa tatraiva līnaḥ| prasādī 
śivaliṃgāṃgatvāt(,) sa tatraiva līnaḥ | prāṇaliṃgī 
jaṃgamaliṃgāṃgatvāt(,) sa tatraiva līnaḥ| śaraṇaḥ prasādaliṃgāṃgatvāt(,) 
sa tatraiva līnaḥ | aikyo hi mahāliṃgāṃgatvāt(,) sa tatraiva līna iti 
vimarśanīyam ||
athācāraliṃgaṃ guruliṃge(,) guruliṃgaṃ śivaliṃge(,) śivaliṃgaṃ 
jaṃgamaliṃge(,) jaṃgamaliṃgaṃ prasādaliṃge(,) prasādaliṃgaṃ mahāliṃge(,) 
mahāliṃgaṃ ghanaliṃgaikalolībhūtaṃ sadakhaṃḍāmarśaparibṛṃhitaṃ 
sadāsti | liṃgaṣaṭkasya cidānaṃdapratiphalanakalanātmakatvāditi || 
evaṃvidhaliṃgāṃgasāmarasyaṃ vivartavāde na saṃbhavati(,) 
mānasādibhūmyaṃtaprameyaṣaṭkasyāvidyākāryatvena mithyātvāditi 
vimarśanīyaṃ | evaṃvidhaṣaṭsthalajñānavāneva sarvotkṛṣṭaḥ uktaṃ ca 
śāṃkarasaṃhitāyāṃ || 
krimikīṭapataṃgebhyaḥ paśavaḥ prajñayā'dhikāḥ || 
paśubhyo'pi narāḥ śreṣṭhāsteṣu śreṣṭhā dvijātayaḥ || 
dvijātiṣvadhikā viprā vipreṣu ṛtubuddhayaḥ || 
ṛtubuddhiṣu kartārastebhyaḥ saṃnyāsino'dhikāḥ || 
tebhyo vijñāninaḥ śreṣṭhāsteṣu śaṃkarapūjakāḥ || 
teṣu śreṣṭhā mahābhāga mama liṃgāṃgasaṃginaḥ||
liṃgāṃgasaṃgiṣvadhikaḥ ṣaṭsthalajñānavān bhavet || 
tasmādabhyadhiko nāsti triṣu lokeṣu sarvadā || 
iti atra brāhmaṇasya liṃgadhāraṇaṃ kathamaśrautatvāditi nāśaṃkanīyaṃ 
pāṇimantraṃ pavitraṃ syāditi śrutivinirṇaya iti tatraivoktatvāt 
triyaṃbakaṃ yajāmaha iti śrutatvācca | 
yajadevapūjāsaṃgatikaraṇadāneṣviti dhātoḥ liṃgāṃgasaṃbandhasya 
prāptatvāditi saṃkṣepaḥ|| 
ayamaparo viśeṣaḥ uktavidhaṣaṭtriṃśattattvātmakasya viśvasya vidyāsu 
śrutirutkṛṣṭā rudraikādaśinī śrutau || tatra paṃcākṣarī tasyāṃ śiva 
ityakṣaradvayaṃ || iti paurāṇikokteḥ(,) śiva ityakṣaradvayasya 
jīvaratnatvāt | tadaṃtarbhāvaprakāro'pi vimarśanīyaḥ || nanu 
tattvānāmasādhāraṇalakṣaṇaṃ vinā tatpratijñānāsaṃbhavāt kathaṃ 
tadaṃtarbhāvaprakāro vimarśanīya iti ceducyate | atroktaliṃgatattveṣu 
sādākhyānāṃ nāmadheyamātratvāt(,) kalānāṃ vimarśāṃśatvāt(,) 
liṃgānāṃ prakāśāṃtargatatvāt(,) tadekarūpameva | evaṃ ca 
vimarśaparibṛṃhitaṃ 

<pṛ0 34> brahmaiva svakrīḍārthaṃ līlayā 
śivaśaktisadāśiveśvaraśuddhavidyāmāyākalāvidyārāgakālaniyatipuruṣapra
kṛtyahaṃkārabuddhimanaḥ 
śrotṛtvakcakṣurjihvāghrāṇavākpāṇipādapāyūpasthaśabdasparśarūparasaga
ṃdhākāśavāyuvahnisalilabhūmaya iti ṣaṭtriṃśattattvātmanā bhidyate | 
tathāhi| anādinidhanācchāṃtācchivātparamakāraṇāt || 
icchāśaktirviniṣkrāṃtā tato jñānaṃ tataḥ kriyā || tayotpannāni 
bhūtāni bhuvanāni caturdaśa || ityāgamokteḥ || ardhaṃ kriyā bhavati 
dakṣiṇamanyadardhaṃ jñānaṃ samatvamanayorapi madhyamicchā || icchaiva 
mūlamuditāṃtarabāhyagatyā jñānaṃ kriyā ca khalu mūlamihāṃkurasya || 
iti mātṛkācakravivekasthiteśca | sṛṣṭyunmukhasya maheśvarasya 
svecchāśaktyaṃtaraṃgabhūtajñānāṃśapraviṣṭaprathamodyoga eva 
bhāvicarācaraprapaṃcanimittakāraṇaṃ 
sarvajñasarvakartṛnīlakaṃṭhomāpatitrilocanatvādilakṣaṇaṃ śivatattvamiti 
| idameva īśānamaṃtrapratipādyasadāśivatattvaṃ || īśānaḥ 
sarvavidyānāmīśvaraḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ 
brahmādhipatirbrahmaṇo'dhipatirbrahmā śivo me astu sadāśivomiti śruteḥ 
asyāyamarthaḥ || sarvavidyānāṃ catuḥṣaṣṭikalānāṃ īśānaḥ adhipatiḥ(,) 
anena sarvajñatvamuktaṃ | sarvabhūtānāṃ bhavanaśīlānāṃ 
carācaraprāṇināmīśvaraḥ niyāmakaḥ(,) etena sarvakartṛtvamuktaṃ 
brahmādhipatiḥ brahmaṇāṃ tatpuruṣādisadyojātāṃtānāṃ 
īśarudraviṣṇubrahmaṇāṃ tirodhānādikṛtyacatuṣṭayaniyamitānāṃ 
adhipatiḥ tajjanakatvena tanniyāmakaḥ(,) brahmaṇo'dhipatiḥ brahmaṇaḥ tapasaḥ 
adhipatiḥ brahmā paramānaṃdaparibṛṃhitaḥ(,) śivaḥ svacchaprakāśaḥ(,) 
vaśakāṃtāvitidhātoḥ|| atha vā'naṃtakalyāṇaguṇaikanidhirīśvaraḥ|| 
śiva ityucyate sadbhiḥ śivatattvārthavedibhiḥ || iti paurāṇikokteḥ(,) 
kalyāṇaguṇaparipūrṇo vā | sadāśivaḥ(,) sat ā śivaḥ iti vicchedena 
saccidānaṃdarūpaḥ(,) ākārasya ānaṃdavācakatvāt(,) praṇavaikalolībhāvena 
pratīyamānatvāt(,) tatpratipādyaḥ praṇavāṃśībhūtākārasya 
prātilomyenomāyāṃ pratīyamānatvāt(,) tatpatiśca evaṃbhūtaḥ sadāśivaḥ me 
mama tirodhānakalāniṣṭhahṛdayasya astu anugrahaprado bhavatviti | 
etanmaṃtrāṃtaragatatvena śaivasaptākṣarī sphuratīti vimarśanīyaṃ | 
idameva sarvaiśvaryaviśrāṃtisthānarūpaṃ paramaśivasya upacārāttattveṣu 
parigaṇanāmātraṃ | idameva mumukṣūpāsyaṃ etatprasādenaiva paraśivaika(-) 

<pṛ0 35> lolībhāvalakṣaṇā paramamuktirityavagaṃtavyaṃ | ayameva jagadguruḥ 
īśānaḥ sarvavidyānāṃ sa evādigururbudhāḥ || tasya śiṣyo 
mahāviṣṇurdivyajñānamahodadhiḥ || iti paurāṇikokteḥ 
nārāyaṇāvirbhāvakāraṇaṃ ca(,) atha svecchāśakteḥ 
bahiraṃgarūpakriyāṃśapraviṣṭodyoga eva(,) bhāviviśvopādānakāraṇaṃ 
śaktitattvaṃ bhavati | etatpuṃbhāvavilāsa eva nārāyaṇaḥ 
athaivaṃvidhaśaktitattvameva 
svecchāśaktyaṃtaraṃgabhūtajñānaśaktyudrekāvasthāpraviṣṭaṃ sat 
jalādhivāsitacaṇakādivat 
pūrvāvasthāvailakṣaṇyenāṃkurāyamāṇedaṃtāprathamarūpaṃ 
garbhāvarakavat svāhaṃtayā''cchādya vartamānaviśvasphuraṇarūpaṃ 
sādākhyarudratattvaṃ sadāśivāṃśībhūtaṃ | atha tacchaktitattvameva(,) 
svakriyāśaktyudrekadaśāyāṃ praviṣṭaṃ 
satkṛtavastuvadaṃkuritamidaṃtārūpaṃ svāhaṃtayā''cchādya 
sthitaviśvasphūrtimayamīśvaratattvaṃ(,) 
śaktitattvapuṃbhāvalīlāsvarūpanārāyaṇākhyaṃ | atha 
kriyāpradhānedaṃtāyāḥ saṃvidrūpāhaṃtāṃtargatatattvena bhāsamānatvāt(,) 
vibhāganibaṃdhanabhedaghaṭitasāgarataraṃganyāyenāhaṃtedaṃtayoraikyapratipa
ttirbrahmāparaparyāyaśuddhavidyātattvaṃ bhavati | 
guruśāstralabdhanirmalasaṃvittiritīti yāvat | 
athaivaṃvidhaśuddhavidyātattvamevāṃḍarasanyāyena svāṃtarlīneṣu 
bhavanakriyonmukheṣu bhāveṣu anyonyābhāvanibaṃdhanabhedabuddhipradhānaṃ sat 
māyātattvaṃ bhavati || kalāsaptadaśī devī svāṃtarlīnacarācareti 
āgamokteḥ || idaṃ sarvaṃ jagatpūrvaṃ pralaye parameśvare || māyābhinne 
svamāyākhyakāraṇābhedarūpataḥ || vartate vāsanārūpeṇaiva 
nābhāvarūpataḥ iti parāśaropapurāṇavacanācca(,) 
svāṃtarlīnacarācarātparameśvarāt(,) kāṣṭhayogena 
vahnervisphuliṃgāvirbhāvavat tadicchāśaktivaśādvibhaktaḥ san(,) uktalakṣaṇa 
māyāśaktau pratibiṃbagatyā praviṣṭo yaḥ prakāśaḥ(,) sa puruṣatattvaṃ 
bhavati | asya svataṃtraprakāśamaheśvarādvicchinnatvena māyākrāṃtatvāt(,) 
nāhamīśvara ityātmanyanātmatājñaptirāvirbhavati | tathaivānātmani 
dehādāvātmatājñaptiśca(,) etaddvayamāṇavaṃ | tata eva 
śubhāśubhavāsanārūṣitakārmamalamanyonyābhāvabhedalakṣaṇamāyikamalaṃ 
ca prāptaṃ bhavati | evaṃvidhamalatrayaśṛṃkhalitatvādeva(,) saṃsārītyucyate 
| asya puruṣasya maheśvarādvibhaktatvena māyāpahṛtaiśvaryatvāt(,) 
asaṃkucitatatkartṛtāśaktireva kiṃcitkartṛtālakṣaṇakalātattvaṃ bhavati | 
jñātṛtāśaktireva kiṃcijjñatvalakṣaṇamavidyātattvaṃ bhavati | 
pūrṇatāśaktirevāpūrṇatāṃ prāpya 
srakcaṃdanavanitādiviṣayāsaktilakṣaṇarāgatattvaṃ

<pṛ0 36> bhavati | tathā nityatāṃ hyanityatāṃ prāpya(,) 
bhūtabhaviṣyadvartamānarūpakramākarakālatattvaṃ bhavati | tathā(,) 
vyāpakatāṃ hyavyāpakatāṃ prāpya(,) mayedaṃ kartavyamiti(,) 
niyamahetubhūtaniyatitattvaṃ bhavati | evaṃvidhakalādipaṃcakamasya puruṣasya 
śaṃkaraśāsanādaparicchinnasvasvarūpāvaraṇahetutvātkaṃcukamityāgameṣūcy
ate | athaunmukhyagarbhitecchāśaktireva(,) pratisphuraṇagatyā 
svagatajñānakriyānyonyābhāvalakṣaṇamāyāpratisphuraṇarūpasukhaduḥkhamoha
pradasatvarajastamasāṃ 
sāmyāvasthālakṣaṇamahaṃkārādibhūmyaṃtatrayoviṃśatitattvamūlakāraṇaṃ
(,) prakṛtitattvaṃ bhavati | atha(,) ahaṃ 
mamedamityabhimānasādhanamahaṃkāratattvaṃ bhavati | 
niścayaheturbuddhitattvaṃ bhavati | sthāṇurvā puruṣo veti 
saṃkalpavikalpasādhanaṃ manastattvaṃ(,) 
samīcīnakalpasthāṇutvabuddherviparītatvātpuruṣatvabuddhervikalpatvaṃ(,) 
etattritayaṃ śarīrāṃtaḥsthitvā(,) 
sukhādivedyāvadhānakaraṇarūpatvādaṃtaḥkaraṇaṃ(,) icchāśaktipradhānaṃ | 
atha śarīrabāhyalagnaṃ sat śabdajñānaikakaraṇaṃ śrotraṃ(,) 
sparśajñānaikakaraṇaṃ tvak(,) rūpajñānaikakaraṇaṃ cakṣuḥ(,) 
rasajñānaikakaraṇaṃ rasanaṃ(,) gandhajñānaikakaraṇaṃ ghrāṇaṃ(,) 
etatpaṃcakaṃ jñānaśaktipradhānatvāt jñāneṃdriyamityucyate | 
aṃtaḥkaraṇasya śabdāśabdādisādhāraṇatvādetasya               
śabdādyasādhāraṇatvāt nātivyāptiḥ | athoccāraṇakriyāheturvāk(,) 
dānādānādikriyāhetuḥ pāṇiḥ(,) gamanāgamanakriyāsādhanaṃ pādaṃ(,) 
bhuktajīrṇamalaparityāgasādhanaṃ pāyuḥ(,) 
retomūtraparityāgakriyāsādhanamupasthakaṃ(,) etatpaṃcakaṃ 
kriyāśaktipradhānatvāt karmaiṃdriyamityucyate | 
etatkaraṇacaturdaśakamicchājñānakriyātmakamityavagaṃtavyaṃ | atha 
śrotraikavedyaḥ śabdaḥ(,) tvagekavedyaḥ sparśaḥ(,) netraikavedyaṃ rūpaṃ(,) 
rasanaikavedyo rasaḥ(,) ghrāṇaikavedyo gandhaḥ(,) eteṣāṃ 
dhvanivarṇaśītoṣṇanīlapītamadhurāmlasurabhyasurabhitvādivibhāgaśūnyatve
na sāmānyarūpatvāttanmātrarūpatvena vyapadeśaḥ| atha 
marudagnyaṃbubhūmīnāmavakāśapradaṃ śabdaikaguṇakamākāśaṃ(,) 
kampabhramaṇaśoṣaṇavegavān sparśaikaguṇo vāyuḥ(,) dāhakaṃ pācakaṃ 
rūpavattejaḥ(,) aṃtaścaṃdrādiśītatejasi dāhakatvābhāvepi 
sasyādivardhanarūpapācakatvasthiternāvyāptiḥ | drāvakaṃ 
plāvakamāpyāyakaṃ rasaikaguṇakaṃ salilaṃ(,) gaṃdhaikaguṇakaṃ 
jalatattvādhārakaṃ chedyaṃ pācyaṃ bhūtattvamiti etānyākāśādīni 
mahābhūtānītyucyaṃte | atraivaṃvidhaṣaṭtriṃśattattveṣu 
śivādiśuddhavidyāṃtamaṃkurāyamāṇāṃkuritaviśvarūpatvādaparaṃ(,) 
tasyāhaṃtayecchāditattvātparaṃ | evaṃ parāparaṃ mokṣahetutvātturīyaṃ

<pṛ0 37> 
sāgarataraṃganyāyenābhedaparyavasāyivibhāganibandhanabhedabuddhipradhānarūp
atvāt(,) māyātattvasya baṃdhahetutvāt(,) sthūlaviśvamayatvācca | aparaṃ 
anyonyābhāvanibandhanabhedabuddhirūpatvāt(,) atra 
manobuddhyahaṃkāraprakṛtisahitapuruṣāya 
śrotrādibhūmyaṃtaviṃśatitattvāni jāgradavasthāpraviṣṭāni(,) 
sparśavācyatvāt kalādipaṃcakaṃ svapnadaśāpraviṣṭaṃ | aṃtaḥsthitatvena 
tadvācyatvāt(,) māyaikā suptidaśātattvaṃ | moharūpatvāditi vivekaḥ | nanu 
paṃcaviṃśatirātmā bhavati iti śruteḥ(,) tattvānāṃ paṃcaviṃśatyā 
parimitatvātkathaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśadrūpatvamiti cenna 
itthaṃ ṣoḍaśapadārthānāṃ saptapadārthāṃtarbhāva iva(,) tathāhi 
kalādīnāṃ māyākāryatvena māyādiṣaṭkaṃcukasyāpi kaṃcuke 
puruṣāṃtargatatvāt(,) māyādiniyatyaṃtasya tatkaṃcukatvena tadaṃtargatatvāt(,) 
prakṛtyādimānasāṃtacatuṣṭayasya tadaṃtaḥkaraṇarūpatvāt(,) 
prakṛteścittāparaparyāyatvāt | śrotrādyupasthāṃtānāṃ 
tadīyajñānakarmākṣarūpatvāt(,) tanmātrapaṃcakasya tadbhojyarūpatvāt(,) 
bhūtapaṃcakasya taccharīratvāt(,) śivādipaṃcakasya tūṣmākṣaravācyatvāt(,) 
ūṣmaṇāṃ śaktirūpatvāt(,) śaktīnāṃ paramaśivasvabhāvatvena 
tadīyaśuddhānusaṃdhānarūpatvena tadekarūpatvānna virodha iti vivekaḥ ||
evaṃvidhaṣaṭtriṃśattattvātmakaṃ viśvaṃ || śhivo vā praṇavaḥ proktaḥ 
praṇavo vā śivātmakaḥ || vācyavācakayorbhedo nātyaṃtaṃ bhidyate kvacit 
|| iti paurāṇikokteḥ | śadāśivomiti śruteḥ 
ahamityakramākrāṃtajagattritayamaṃḍalaḥ || vartate devi vīreṃdra iti 
śāṃbhavanirṇayaḥ || akāraḥ sarvavarṇāgryaḥ prakāśaḥ paramaḥ śivaḥ 
|| ikāro'ntyaḥ kalārūpo vimarśākhyaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || anayoḥ 
samarasākārādahamityeva nirmalaḥ|| ityāgamokteḥ(,) ahamasmi 
prathamajetyādiśruteśca mūlapraṇavaikavigrahakapūrṇāhaṃtātmakaśive 
mayūrāṃḍarasanyāyena sāmarasyena saṃkṣiptaṃ | tathāhi śiva ityatra 
varṇacatuṣṭayasya bhāsamānatvāt triṃśikāśāstrasthityā vakārasya 
māyātattvavācakatvāt(,) māyāṃtaikatriṃśattattvāni 
tadvācakakādivāṃtākṣarāṇi ca vakārāṃtargatāni 
kalādibhūmyaṃtatriṃśattattvānāṃ tatkāryatvāt vāyvagnisalileṃdrāṇāṃ 
dhāraṇānāṃ catuṣṭayam ityuktatvāt(,) 
śuddhavidyādiśaktyaṃtatattvacatuṣṭayaṃ tadvācakaśavargaśca 
śakāreṃ'tarbhūtaḥ tadūrdhvaṃ śādivikhyātaṃ purastādbrahmapaṃcakam 
ityuktatvāt(,) akāre tvanugrahātmakaṣoḍaśakalāparipūrṇasadāśivatattvaṃ | 
tatkalāvācakaṣoḍaśasvarāścāṃtargatāḥ | 

<pṛ0 38> śakāramastakasthitekāre tvetatkaraṇībhūtatacchaktiścakāsti | 
anuttarādiṣaṭsvaraśaktiṣvikārasyecchāvidhānāt(,) samaṣṭyā paramaśiva iti 
viśvaṃ śivādvaitakalpapādapamaṃjarīrūpaṃ vimarśanīyaṃ ||
evamahamityatrāpi atra makārasya puruṣatattvavācakatvāt || pṛthivyādīni 
tattvāni puruṣāṃtāni paṃcasu || kramātkādiṣu vargeṣu makārāṃteṣu 
suvrata || ityuktatvāt(,) māyāṃtatattvāni puruṣeṃtargatāni | puruṣaḥ 
prakṛtistho hi bhuṃkte prakṛtijān guṇān ti gītatvāt | anyatsarvaṃ 
pūrvavat | kāraṇībhūtā śaktistu hakārādeva tasya vimarśavācakatvāt(,) 
tathā pradarśitatvāt | evamomityatrāpi tasyākārokāramakārarūpatvāt 
ukārasya hakārasūkṣmatvena triṃśikātattvavivaraṇe prakaṭīkṛtatvāt | 
anyat pūrvavat | evamoṃ śivohamekārthaviśrāṃtatvena 
mātṛkāsaṃgraharūpatve śrautatvācca | maheśvarapratipādakatvena ca 
mahāmaṃtrarūpatvāt(,) mumukṣurevaṃvidhānusaṃdhānavāneva bhavet | tameva 
vidvānamṛta iha bhavati iti śruteḥ evamuktakrameṇa 
śivasūtrasaṃpratipannadṛkkriyātmakacaitanyapratipādakabrahmasūtraṣaṭsthala
brahmaṣaṭtriṃśattattvamahāmaṃtraparijñānavān iha janmani asminneva dehe 
amṛto bhavati | āhāravyavahārādinā laukikavadvartamāno'pi 
janmāṃtarābhāvājjīvanmuktaḥ|| piṃḍapātānaṃtaraṃ 
sarvajñatādiśaktīnāṃ vikāsāt(,) sākṣānmukto bhavatīti nūnaṃ | nanu asya 
maṃtrasya puruṣasūktāṃtargatatvāt(,) itaḥ
pūrvaṃ 
dṛkkriyātmakacaitanyasya ṣaṭsthalabrahmaṇaḥ ṣaṭtriṃśattattvānāṃ 
mahāmaṃtrasya cāprāptatvāt(,) kathamuktārthasiddhiriti cet śahasrākṣa iti 
śa bhūmiṃ viśvato vṛtvā atyatiṣṭhaddaśāṃgulaṃ || 
utāmṛtatvasyeśānaḥ etāvānasya mahimā ato jyāyāṃśca pūruṣaḥ iti 
śrutatvāt(,) sahasrākṣatvaprakaṭanena jñātṛtāśakteḥ(,) īśānityaṃtena 
viśvataduttīrṇatayā bhavanamokṣakartṛtālakṣaṇakriyāśakteḥ(,) etāvānasya 
mahimetyanena jaḍajīvalakṣaṇajñānakriyāsvataṃtracaitanyasya copāttatvāt(,) 
ato jyāyānityuktatvāt || caitanyaṃ dṛkkriyārūpaṃ śivasya paramasya yat || 
svātaṃtryametadevātmā tato'sau paramaḥ śivaḥ || iti 
śivasūtravārtikasthiteḥ tadekārthatvāt pādo'sya viśvābhūtānīti 
śruteḥ ṣaṭtriṃśattattvānāṃ tadaṃtargatatvāt tripādasyāmṛtaṃ divi 
tripādūrdhvamudaitpuruṣa iti śrutatvena ṣaṭsthalabrahmaṇāṃ 
mahāmaṃtratamasya ca prāptatvāt(,) athaivaṃvidhaparāmarśavataḥ ālāpa eva 
japaḥ(,)

<pṛ0 39> tatpravṛttireva vrataṃ(,) kathā japaḥ(,) śarīrapravṛttirvratamiti 
śivena sūcitatvāt tasmātsarvasyāpi śivākṣaracatuṣṭayasaṃpannatvāt(,) 
śivam ||

