<pṛ0 1> ūṃ śrīmate reṇukācāryāya namaḥ 
{atha śaivasiddhāṃtadīpikānāma
pāśupatamataprakaraṇam }

avarṇavigrahaṃ devaṃ varṇavigrahavarjitaṃ | 
varṇavigrahavaktāraṃ namāmi staumi saṃśraye || 1 || 
carācarātmakaṃ viśvamotaprotaṃ ca sarvataḥ|
paśupāśabhidā yena namastasmai puradviṣe || 2 || 
iha tāvajjātikulādyabhimānāspadamidaṃ sthūladehaṃ 
pṛthivyaptejovāyvākāśānāṃ samavāyaḥ| tatra prāktanapuṇyapāpānukūlaṃ 
brāhmaṇādivarṇāṃśca rūpaśriyāviṃdriyapāṭavamapi bibhrato niyatāyuṣo 
niyatabhogāśca bhavanti bhoktāra ātmānaḥ | eteṣāṃ bhogaparikarībhūtāni 
sṛṣṭimārabhyānītāni pṛthivītattvamārabhya kalātatvāntāni 
triṃśattattvāni ātmanyātmani pṛthakpṛthak atyaṃtasūkṣmasya karmaṇā 
prāptasyāyuṣo'nte pūrvaśarīraṃ vihāya tṛṇajalūkavadāśrayiṣyatyaparaṃ 
śarīraṃ tena kṛtānāṃ puṇyapāpānāmāśraya ātmā(,) śarīrādanyaḥ 
jñānakriyārūpaḥ(,) nityaḥ amūrtaḥ vyāpakaśca 
āṇavakārmamāyīyabaiṃdavarodhaśaktyātmakapāśapaṃcakabaddhaḥ saṃsārī 
puruṣaḥ | 
asya bhogaparikarībhūtasūkṣmaśarīrabhūtatattvāni kānīti cet 
pṛthivyaptejovāyvākāśatattvānīti kathitānīmāni bhūtāni paṃca eteṣāṃ 
kāraṇaṃ sanmātrapaṃcakaṃ kimiti cet (?) gaṃdhatattvaṃ(,) rasatattvaṃ(,) 
rūpatattvaṃ(,) sparśatattvaṃ(,) śabdatattvaṃ ceti etaddaśakaṃ kāryamityucyate 
| vākpāṇipādapāyūpasthānīti paṃca karmaiṃdriyāṇi eteṣāṃ guṇā 
vacanagamanādānavisargānaṃdāḥ | śrotratvakcakṣurjihvāghrāṇānīti paṃca 
jñāneṃdriyāṇi(,) eteṣāṃ guṇāḥ śabdasparśarūparasagaṃdhāḥ | etasya 
vāgādipaṃcakasya śrotrādipaṃcakasya ca karaṇamityabhihitaṃ | 
manaścāhaṃkāraśca buddhiśceti tritayametat 
śrotrādīṃdriyavadasmāccharīrādbahirnirgatya vyāpāramakṛtvā'sya 
śarīrasyāntaravakāśe sthitvā kriyāpravartakatvāt 
aṃtaḥkaraṇamityeteṣāṃ trayāṇāṃ nāma | arthānāṃ 

<pṛ0 2> saṃkalpanaṃ ca śrotrādīṃdriyāṇāṃ bāhyaviṣayeṣu pravartanaṃ ca 
manasovṛttiḥ | abhimānakalpanaṃ ca prāṇādivāyūnāṃ preraṇaṃ ca 
ahaṃkāravṛttiḥ | adhyavasāyo buddhervṛttiḥ | etadrajatameva na śuktiriti 
niścayo'dhyavasāya iti | pūrvamuktāni trayoviṃśatitattvāni 
eteṣvadhyavasāyakāraṇabhūtādbuddhitatvāt sātvikarājasatāmasabhedena 
bhinno'haṃkāro jāyate | atra sātvikāhaṃkārānmanaśca 
śrotrādipaṃcajñāneṃdriyāṇi ca jāyante | atra 
rājasāhaṃkārādvāgādipaṃcakarmaiṃdriyāṇi jāyante | atra 
tāmasāhaṃkārādgaṃdhāditanmātrakaṃ jātaṃ | 
etasmāttanmātrapaṃcakādbhūtāni paṃca jātāni | dhāraṇā ca 
samūhīkaraṇaṃ ca dāhakatvaṃ ca avayavaghaṭanakaraṇaṃ ca 
itarabhūtacatuṣṭayasyāvakāśadānaṃ ca paṃcabhūtānāṃ vṛttayaḥ | atra 
pṛthivyāḥ śabdasparśarūparasāḥ sāmānyaguṇāḥ 
gaṃdhastvasāmānyaguṇaḥ | apāṃ śabdasparśarūpāṇi sāmānyaguṇāḥ 
rasastvasāmānyaguṇaḥ | tejasaḥ śabdasparśau sāmānyaguṇau(,) rūpaṃ 
cāsāmānyaguṇaḥ | vāyoḥ śabdaḥ sāmānyaguṇaḥ(,) 
sparśastvasāmānyaguṇaḥ | ākāśasya śabda eka eva guṇaḥ | ayaṃ śabdaḥ 
pratidhvanirvarṇātmako na bhavati | dvāviṃśateḥ parasya buddhitattvasya 
kāraṇaṃ guṇatattvaṃ | etacca satvamiti ca raja iti ca tama iti cābhihitaṃ | 
tridhābhūya krameṇa sukhaduḥkhamohānāṃ ca kāraṇaṃ bhavati | asya 
guṇatattvasya kāraṇaṃ prakṛtitattvaṃ guṇatattvaṃ caturviṃśatitattvaṃ(,) 
prakṛtitattvaṃ paṃcaviṃśatitattvaṃ etasminnubhayasmiṃstattve 
prakṛtitattvasya kāryaṃ guṇatattvamiti pratipāditaṃ | guṇatattvasya kāryaṃ 
sukhaduḥkhamohahetutvaṃ ca 
svavyatiriktārvāgbuddhyāditrayoviṃśatitattvānāṃ krameṇa kāraṇaṃ ca 
pṛthivītattvamārabhya prakṛtitattvāntapaṃcaviṃśateḥ aśuddhādhveti nāma 
|
ita ūrdhvaṃ rāgatattvaṃ(,) asya vṛttiḥ prakṛtijātavastūnāmātmane 
prarocanaṃ | ata ūrdhvaṃ niyatitattvaṃ(,) asya vṛttiḥ ātmanaḥ svena svenaiva 
kṛtāni karmāṇi ātmanaiva bhoktavyānīti niyamanaṃ | ita ūrdhvaṃ 
kālatattvaṃ(,) asya vṛttiḥ dīrghakālaṃ bhuṃkte svalpakālaṃ bhuṃkta iti 
puruṣasya bhogaparicchedaḥ | ataḥ paraṃ vidyātattvaṃ asya vṛttiḥ 
viṣayoparaktāṃ buddhiṃ puruṣe gṛhṇātīti karaṇabhūtattvaṃ | asmātparaṃ 
kalātattvaṃ asya vṛttiḥ 
ātmano'nādibhūtatāmrakālikāvatsahajamalaśakterekadeśamapasārya 
ātmasvarūpasya prakāśanaṃ | asya kāraṇaṃ māyātattvaṃ | 
pūrvoktaprakṛtitattvarāgatattvavidyātattvānāmutpattiḥ 

<pṛ0 3> kalātattve | niyatikālakalātattvānāmutpattirmāyātattve 
kalātattvavidyātattvakālatattvaniyatitattvarāgatattvāni 
paṃcakaṃcukamityucyate | etenāvṛtasya bodhyātmanaḥ puṃsttvamiti malasya 
sadbhāvātpuruṣatattvamiti vyapadeśaḥ ata ātmano jaḍarūpatvaṃ | 
rāgatatvamārabhya kalātatvāntāni paṃcatatvāni miśrādhvetyucyante |
etānyekatriṃśattattvāni | ātmanyātmani pārthakyena sūkṣmadehāni bhavanti 
| eteṣāṃ kāryāṇāṃ bhuvanaśarīrāṇāmāśrayiṇāṃ 
bhuvanānāmāśrayāṇāṃ sarvātmanāṃ sādhāraṇāni triṃśattattvāni | 
eteṣāṃ sarveṣāṃ kāraṇamaśuddhamāyātattvaṃ | idaṃ māyātatvaṃ nityaṃ 
vyāpakaṃ samastātmakarmasaṃbaddhaṃ | svavṛttidvāreṇa 
jñānakriyāprakāśībhavadapi mohakaṃ | itaḥparaṃ dvātriṃśakaṃ 
vidyātattvaṃ itaḥparaṃ trayastriṃśakamīśvaratattvaṃ | asmin 
śuddhavidyātattve saptakoṭimahāmaṃtrāḥ | 
śrīmatkāmikādyaṣṭāviṃśatisaṃhitāśca naṃdyādayo'ṣṭau 
gaṇeśvarāśca siddhāntaśāstreṇa pūjyamānāḥ iṃdrādilokapālāśca 
eteṣāmāyudhāni vajrādīni ca vasanti | īśvaratattve vidyeśvarāḥ 
anaṃtādayo'ṣṭau vartante | eteṣvanaṃtaḥ sarveśvaratvāt teṣāṃ 
vidyeśvarāṇāṃ vidyātattvavāsināṃ cānyeṣāṃ ceśvarabhūto 
māyākṣobhakaśca māyīyatattvabhuvanānāṃ sraṣṭā ca | kiṃcāyaṃ 
parameśvarādbhinnaḥ ekamalayuktaśca malapākena parameśvareṇānugṛhītaśca 
bhavati anena sṛṣṭirūpeṇāṇavakārmabaṃdhadvayavaṃtaḥ pralayākalā 
ityabhihite ātmarāśau malapākavanto niradhikaraṇenaiva 
parameśvareṇānugṛhītā aṣṭādaśābhyadhikaṃ śatarudrāḥ santi | eteṣu 
śrīkaṃṭhasaṃjño rudro              madhyapralayānte 
prakṛtitattvādarvāktattveṣu bhuvanānāṃ ca sraṣṭā(,) 
āṇavakārmamāyīyātmakabaṃdhatritayena yuktānāṃ sakalanāmnāmātmanāṃ 
rāśau jñānayogatapo'dhyayanādibhirviśiṣṭaśca 
brahmaviṣṇupadayornirvāhakaśca bhavati | asya madhyapralayasamaye 
rāgatattve'vasthānaṃ | paścātsṛṣṭikāle prāpte 
aśuddhādhvasṛṣṭipūrvaṃ brahmaviṣṇusṛṣṭīnāmadhiṣṭhātā sthitvā 
atorvāktanabhuvaneśvarāṃśca trayastriṃśatkoṭidevāṃśca brahmāṃḍāni ca 
sṛjati brahmāṃḍaṃ caturdaśabhuvanaṃ sakalānāṃ prajānāmāvāsabhūmiḥ | 
pūrvoktarudreṣu śatarudrāḥ pāṃcabhautikabrahmāṃḍaṃ vinā 
kevalapṛthivītattve sthitvā brahmāṃḍasya rakṣakā bhavanti | guṇatattve 
brahmaviṣṇubhyāṃ saha sthito rudrabhaṭṭārako 
madhyapralayaparyaṃtamadhikāraṃ kṛtvā imau brahmaviṣṇū copasaṃhṛtya 
svayaṃ miśrādhvarāgatattve

<pṛ0 4> vartate anena saha vīrabhadradevaśca vartate | prakṛtimastake'ṣṭau 
kalāmastake'ṣṭau ca śrīkaṃṭhavīrabhadrau ca śatarudrāḥ | 
evamaṣṭādaśābhyadhikaṃ śatarudrāḥ parameśvareṇānugṛhītaśarīriṇo 
bhavanti | brahmaviṣṇupadasthitijananajñānādibhiraspṛṣṭāḥ 
brahmaviṣṇvādipadānyātmakartṛkajñānayogabalena saṃpādayanti | 
eteṣāmaṣṭādaśaśatarudrāṇāṃ malapākātparameśvaraprasādācca 
dīkṣāpūrvakaṃ krameṇa padaprāptiḥ | śuddhavidyātattvavāsināṃ 
malapākātparameśvaraprasādācca padaprāptiḥ | eteṣāṃ vidyeśvarāṇāṃ 
svarūpaṃ baindavaṃ aṣṭādaśādhikaśatarudrāṇāṃ śarīraṃ māyīyaṃ | 
brahmaviṣṇvādīnāṃ śarīraṃ prākṛtaṃ(,) aṣṭādaśaśatarudrāṇāṃ 
vidyeśvarāṇāṃ ca svarūpamiva sākṣātparameśvarasya sakalāni svarūpāṇi 
pūjādiṣu dhyeyāni | brahmaviṣṇuśarīrasya 
prākṛtatvātparameśvarānugrahapūrvamasaṃbhavatvācca brahmaviṣṇuśarīravat 
parameśvaraḥ kenāpi na dhyāyate | brahmaviṣṇupadamubhayaṃ paśubhūmiḥ | 
rudrapadamīśvarapadamubhayaṃ patibhūmiḥ | asmādīśvaratattvādupari 
sadāśivatattvaṃ | ataḥparaṃ śaktitattvaṃ | atūrdhvaṃ śivatattvaṃ | 
etattattvatritayaṃ parameśvarasya adhikārabhogalayatattvasaṃjñānimittaṃ(,) 
etasmiṃstattvatritaye parameśvarādvyatiriktāni         
kartṛbhūtānyātmāntarāṇi na vidyante | layabhogādhikārapadāni 
śraddadhānāḥ sādhakadīkṣayā dīkṣitā maṃtrasādhakāḥ 
paścātparameśvaraprasādena tattadbhuvanaṃ prāpya bhoktāro 
vairāgyaparyaṃtaṃ vā mahāsaṃhāraparyaṃtaṃ vā sthitvā 
vidyeśvaravanmuktāścidātmāno na bhavanti | vidyātattve 
akārādikṣakārāntapaṃcāśadakṣarāṇi 
kāmikādyaṣṭāviṃśatisaṃhitāśca vaikharīrūpāṇi vartante īśvaratattve 
praṇavaśca | sadāśivatattve sakalo binduḥ sakalo nādaśca | śaktitatve 
sūkṣmābhidheyabuddhibījamātmanyātmani pṛthakpṛthagbhūtvā 
sūkṣmanādātmakaṃ puryaṣṭakaṃ tiṣṭhati | śivatattvasya kāraṇaṃ 
biṃduśca biṃdoḥ śivatattvasya ca tatvabhedavyapadeśo nāsti | 
sadāśivaśaktitattve'dhiṣṭhāya sthitasya śivasya sakalaḥ sakalaniṣkalaḥ 
niṣkalaḥ vyaktaḥ vyaktāvyaktaḥ avyaktaḥ maheśvaraḥ sadāśiva iti ca 
nāmāni | eteṣu ṣaṭtriṃśattattveṣu biṃdurnityo vyāpako'mūrtaḥ 
parameśvarasya nityādhiṣṭheyaḥ śabdārthātmakaḥ nādādidvāreṇātmanāṃ 
samyagjñānasya kāraṇaṃ | amohakaśca bhavati | 
māyāvyatiriktasamastavastūnāmupādānaṃ jaḍaśca pṛthvītattvamārabhya 
śivāntāni ṣaṭtriṃśattattvāni tattvādhvā | kālāgnibhuvanamārabhya

<pṛ0 5> anāśritabhuvanaparyaṃtāni bhuvanāni dviśataṃ 
paṃcatriṃśadbhuvanādhvā | akārādikṣakārāntāni paṃcāśadakṣarāṇi 
varṇādhvā | vyomavyāpimantrātmānaḥ ekādaśīti padādhvā | 
mūlabrahmāṃḍarūpāṇi ekādaśamaṃtrādhvā | nivṛttyādipaṃcakalāvā | 
eteṣu kalātattvabhuvanātmānastrayo'dhvāno dravyātmakāḥ 
varṇapadamaṃtrātmānastrayo'dhvānaḥ śabdarūpāḥ | eteṣu bhuvanādhvā 
tattvādhvānamāśritya vartate | tattvādhvā kalādhvānaṃ 
varṇapadamaṃtrātmakāstrayo'dhvāno bhuvanajaśarīrāpekṣayā vartante | 
eteṣāṃ ṣaḍadhvānāṃ paramakāraṇaṃ vastu kuṃḍalinīti ca śuddhavidyeti 
ca brahmeti cocyate | ete ṣaḍadhvāna ātmanāṃ 
saṃsāraḥ ṣaḍadhvavyatiriktā nityā vyāpakāścetanāḥ pratiśarīraṃ 
bhinnā malināḥ karmakartāraḥ karmaphalabhoktāraḥ kiṃcijjñāḥ 
kiṃcitkartāraḥ seśvarāśca bhavantyātmānaḥ | ete baṃdhabhedena 
sakalapralayākalavijñānākalā iti trividhā ucyante | eteṣāmātmanāṃ 
māyīyabaṃdhaḥ kalādipṛthivyaṃtatattvabhuvanabhauvanādirūpaḥ | 
kāmyabaṃdho jyotiṣṭomabrahmahatyādibhirutpannaḥ apūrvākhyasaṃskārarūpaḥ 
puryaṣṭakamadhyagatabuddhitattvamāśritya sukhaduḥkhamohātmakaphalaśca 
bhavati | malākhyo baṃdhaḥ ātmanāṃ svarūpajñānakriyāvārakaḥ 
ātmanyātmani         pṛthakpṛthagbhūtvā svakālānte 
vyāpayiṣyadanekaśaktisahito nityo vyāpako jaḍadravyaṃ ca bhavati | baiṃdavo 
baṃdho vidyāvidyeśvarādiśarīrāṇāṃ kāraṇaṃ 
sakalākhyasaṃsāribhogaparikarībhūtasūkṣmādivaikharyantaśabdahetuśca 
rodhaśaktyātmakaḥ pāśo 
māyīyakārmāṇavabaiṃdavapāśacatuṣṭayasyānādidharmahetuśca 
śivaśaktireva upacārātpāśa ityucyate | śuddhādhvavartināṃ baiṃdavo 
rodhaśaktiśceti pāśadvayameva | miśrādhvavartināṃ tu etaddvayaṃ cāṇavaḥ 
kārmikaśceti pāśacatuṣṭayaṃ | aśuddhādhvavartināṃ tu etaccatuṣṭayaṃ 
māyīyaśceti baṃdhāḥ paṃca | eteṣu triṣvadhvavartiṣu 
śuddhādhvavāsināṃ muktānāmiva niratiśayasukhameva duḥkhaspṛṣṭāḥ 
sukhaduḥkhamohāśca na santi | ato hetorayaṃ śuddhādhvetyabhidhīyate | 
miśrādhvavāsināṃ tu sarvajñatāyāmapi sukhaduḥkhamohāśca santi | ato 
hetorayaṃ miśrādhvetyabhidhīyate | aśuddhādhvavāsināṃ tu kiṃcijjñatvaṃ 
kiṃcitkartṛtvaṃ ca sukhaduḥkhamohāśca santi | ato 
hetorayamaśuddhādhvetyabhidhīyate | atra baiṃdavo māyīyaśca 
pāśāvāgaṃtukau | kārmapāśastu pravāhānādirbhogāvasādhanaḥ | 
āṇavapāśastu kūṭasthānādiḥ svapākānte parameśvaraprasādātmikayā 

<pṛ0 6> dīkṣayā nivartyaḥ| kārmapāśastu vijñānayogasaṃnyāsairvā bhogena 
vā kṣīyate | 
ete jñānādayaḥ śāstradvārā saṃpadyante tāni śāstrāṇi paṃcavidhāni 
laukikaṃ vaidikamādhyātmikamatimārgikaṃ māṃtraṃ ceti | laukikaṃ tu 
āyurvedadaṃḍanītyādidṛṣṭaphalaṃ śāstraṃ | vaidikaṃ tu vedeṣu 
kriyābhāgamuddiśya ṛṣibhirjyotiṣṭomādipuṇyapratipādakasvargādisādhakami
imāṃsāśāstraṃ | vedaviṣaye pauruṣeyasādhake padārthapramāṇayoḥ 
parīkṣāṃ kartumṛṣibhiḥ praṇīte nyāyavaiśeṣike śāstre ca(,) 
etattritayaṃ dṛṣṭādṛṣṭaphalaṃ śāstraṃ | 
ādhyātmikaṃ tu 
sāṃkhyapātaṃjalavedāntākhyānyupaniṣadbhāgamuddiśya ṛṣibhiḥ 
praṇītāni ātmajñānaphalāni śāstrāṇi | atimārgikaṃ tu śāstraṃ 
rudrapraṇītāni pāśupatakāpālamahāvratāni | māṃtraṃ tu śivapraṇītaṃ 
siddhāntaśāstraṃ | 
mīmāṃsāśāstrasya kartā bhagavān jaiminiḥ anena śāstreṇa 
pratipādyamāno'rtho(-)vākyalakṣaṇaṃ ca vedā apauruṣeyā iti ca prapaṃco 
nitya iti ca iṣṭaṃ pūrtaṃ karmānuṣṭheyamiti ca 
karmānuṣṭhānamevānuṣṭhātuḥ svargādisādhanamiti ca 
bhautikaśarīreṃdriyebhyaḥ anye ātmānaḥ ete cāneke etebhyo vilakṣaṇa 
īśvaro na kaściditi ca |
vaiśeṣikaśāstreṇa tu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ pṛthivyaptejovāyava iti 
bhūtāni catvāryanityānīti ca eteṣāṃ kāraṇāni tattannāmāno bhinnāḥ 
paramāṇava iti ca etebhyo'nyacchabdakāraṇaṃ nityaṃ paṃcamamākāśātmakaṃ 
bhūtamiti ca etasmādanyo nityaḥ kālo diśaśca etebhyo 
bhūtakāraṇaśarīreṃdriyebhyo'nye amūrtā nityāḥ | ātmāno'neke etebhyo 
vyatiriktaṃ jñānādihetukaṃ nityaṃ manaśca ātmanyātmanyabhidhīyamānāni 
pṛthivyaptejovāyvākāśakāladigātmamanāṃsīti nava dravyāṇi 
dravyapadārthaḥ etebhyo vyatiriktaḥ rūpādirguṇapadārthaḥ etasmādanya 
utkṣepaṇādikarmapadārthaḥ ato'nyo gotvādiḥ sāmānyapadārthaḥ iha ghaṭe 
śauklyamityādiḥ samavāyapadārthaḥ etebhyaḥ paṃcebhyo'nyo 
viśeṣapadārthaḥ eteṣu ṣaṭsu ātmanaḥ padārthatattvasya manaḥsaṃyogāt 
jñānamutpadyate anena puṇyāpuṇyātmakakarmānuṣṭhānamutpadyate | anena 
pāpātpāpātmakakarmānuṣṭhānamutpadyate anena śarīreṃdriyāṇi ca 
puṇyāpuṇyavaśena svarganarakaprāptiḥ sarvasyāsya nirvāhaka

<pṛ0 7> īśvaraḥ asya manaḥsaṃyogāt jñānāderutpattirna kiṃtu 
svabhāvasiddhaṃ jñānaṃ | itthaṃ padārthānāṃ ṣaṇṇāṃ 
sādharmyavaidharmyajñānena karmakṣayo bhavati manaḥsaṃyogajanitajñānaṃ 
vinā pāṣāṇakalpā vartante ayameva mokṣa iti ca vedā īśvarakartṛkā iti 
ca | 
nyāyaśāstreṇa tu pratipādyamānorthaḥ(-) pratyakṣādipramāṇāni 
prameyasiddhyarthaṃ jñeyānīti ca vaiśeṣikoktakrameṇaiva padārthā 
aite ṣoḍaśavidhā iti ca mokṣalakṣaṇaṃ ca etaduktaprakāramiti ca īśvaraḥ 
padārthatattvasya ca jñānacikīrṣāprayoktā nitya iti ca(,) 
etacchāstradvayapraṇetārau kaṇādākṣapādau ca| 
sāṃkhyaśāstreṇa tu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ(-) nityā vyāpikā jaḍarūpā 
samastavastūnāṃ kāraṇaṃ satvarajastamasāṃ sāmyāvasthā'mūrtā ca 
prakṛtiriyaṃ prakṛtiścaturviṃśatitattvamiti ca | etatkāryaṃ 
buddhitattvamārabhya pṛthvītattvāntāni trayoviṃśatitattvānīti ca(,) 
evaṃbhūtacaturviṃśatitattvebhyo'nye nityāḥ vyāpakāḥ amūrtāḥ 
nānāvidhāḥ sarvakartṛtvasarvajñatvarahitāḥ jñānamātrāḥ ātmānaḥ| 
evaṃ paṃcaviṃśatitattvanīti ca(,) paṃcabhautikaśarīre buddhitattvameva 
pradhānaṃ eteṣāṃ muktidaśāyāṃ saṃsāradaśāyāṃ ca nirviśeṣaṃ 
svarūpaṃ aśuddhirnāstīti ca anādisiddhāyāḥ buddhigatāyāḥ avidyāyā 
vaśātsāṃsārikasukhaduḥkhajñānamutpadyate iti ca | 
prakṛtipuruṣavivekajñānādavidyāyā vināśe mokṣa iti ca ātmabhyovyatirikta 
īśvara iti ca na kaściditi ca etacchāstrapraṇetā kapilaḥ|
pātaṃjalaśāstreṇa tu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ(-) itthaṃ prakṛtiprākṛte ca 
ātmānaśca baṃdhamokṣau ca saṃti | vivekajñānavadyogaśca yogaparikara iti 
ca ṣaḍviṃśatitattvamīśvara ekaḥ asyātmabhyo viśeṣaḥ 
svādhīnatānirmāṇaṃ cittamityākhyāvat kevalasatvarūpadhāraṇaṃ ca 
ātmajñānopadeṣṭṛtvaṃ ceti ca etacchāstrapraṇetā pātaṃjaliḥ | 
vedāntaśāstreṇa tu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ(-) bhāskarīyā māyāvādinaḥ 
śabdabrahmavādinaḥ krīḍābrahmavādinaśceti caturvidhā vedāntavādinaḥ | 
eteṣu bhāskarīyāḥ jaḍājaḍātmakaṃ suranaratiryagādiko vasturāśirakhilo 
brahmapariṇāmaḥ etadbrahmasaccidānaṃdātmakaṃ vyāpakaṃ ca etadeveśvaro 
bhavati asya vikāratvasyājñānātparivartate saṃsāraḥ | ayameka eva 
paramārthataḥ

<pṛ0 8> satyaṃ(,) asya vikārāṇāṃ ca vikāratvādvedāntajñānena 
śarīravyatiriktamātmasvarūpaṃ bhāsate tatparabrahmaiveti vedanīyo mokṣa iti 
ca pratipādayanti 
māyāvādinastu pūrvoktaparabrahmaiva paramārthadṛśyamāno'nyo khilaḥ 
śaṭhaḥ satyāṃ śuktikāyāṃ rajatavajjagadupādānaṃ māyeyaṃ 
brahmavatsatyā ca na bhavati | śaśaviṣāṇavadasatyā ca na bhavati | 
māyāvilakṣaṇaṃ brahmasvarūpaṃ vedāntajñānena svayamiti vedanaṃ mokṣa 
iti pratipādayanti | 
śabdabrahmavādinastu(-)kāraṇaṃ brahmaparamaṃ prameyadaśāyāṃ śabdātmakaṃ 
bhavati | asya vikāro jaḍājaḍātmakaṃ samastavastu vināśyavināśi vastutaḥ 
śabdātmaiva tadeva svarūpaṃ bhavatīti vedanaṃ mokṣa iti ca pratipādayanti | 
krīḍābrahmavādinastu(-) pūrvoktabrahmaivāhaṃ ahaṃ ekākī bhavāmi ahaṃ 
mayaivotpannairuccāvacairvikāravastubhiḥ saha bahudhā 
krīḍāmītyabhisaṃdhinā bahudhā bhavati bahu tadvastu nityaṃ tatsatyaṃ vastu 
svayamityupalabdhimokṣa iti ca pratipādayanti eteṣāṃ matānāṃ praṇetā 
vyāsaḥ | 
mīmāṃsāvaiśeṣikanyāyasāṃkhyapātaṃjalavedāntā iti ṣaṭ śāstrāṇi 
vaidikāni eteṣu vedānta eka eva advaitaśāstramitarāṇi paṃca 
bhedaśāstrāṇi etatṣaṭkaṃ vinā vedabāhyāni nāstikaśāstrāṇi | 
tāni śāstrāṇi kānīti cet bauddhamārhataṃ lokāyatikaṃ ceti trīṇi eteṣu 
lokāyatikaśāstreṇa tu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ(-)pratyakṣapṛthivyaptejovāyava 
evaṃ satyāḥ eteṣāṃ samudāyaḥ śarīramevātmā bhavati etadātmajñānaṃ 
dehavṛddhau vṛddhaṃ syāt kṣīṇe kṣīṇaṃ syāditi īśvara iti na 
kaściddṛṣṭaḥ(,) sukhaduḥkha eva svarganarakau śarīre naṣṭe kartavyaṃ 
kimapyadṛṣṭaṃ nāsti ata eva śarīraṃ vinā ātmeti kaścit na dṛṣṭa iti | 
lokāyatikaśāstrapraṇetā bṛhaspatiḥ |
bauddhaśāstreṇa tu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ(-) pṛthivītattvamārabhya 
buddhitattvāntatrayoviṃśatitattvāni santi eteṣu buddhitattvaṃ pradhānaṃ | 
paṃcabhautikaśarīre buddhitattvamevātmā bhavati | tadevapradhānaṃ | 
etadbuddhitattvamārabhyārvāgvavasturāśirakhilaḥ kṣaṇikaḥ anyathā sthira 
ātmā ca īśvaraścetyetadubhayaṃ nāsti | etacchāstropadeṣṭā sugata 
evopāsyaḥ | mokṣastu jalapravāhavadanityānubhūyamānājñānasaṃtatiḥ | 
sukhaduḥkhasparśaṃ vinā śuddhacitsaṃtatireva syāditi kecit 
kramātkramātpravartamāno dīpaḥ kṣīṇayostailavartyoryathā 

<pṛ0 9> naśyati tadvadajñānasaṃtatināśa eva mokṣa iti kecit | ete 
sautrāṃtikā vaibhāṣikā yogācārikā mādhyamikā iti caturvidhā bhavanti 
eteṣu kecitpratyakṣo'khilo vasturāśirasatyo jñānasaṃtatireva satyeti ca | 
kecidayamakhilo vasturāśirasti api tu kṣaṇika iti ca pratipādayanti |
ārhataistu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ(-) ārhataśāstrapraṇetā arhannevānādisiddho 
jīva iti ko'pi padārtho'nādimohādidoṣasahito vartata iti 
cānyānīṃdriyāṇyapi santīti ca etatsarvametannāmabhiḥ sahaivāsti kāyo 
nāsti kāya iti śabdena vaktavyaḥ | etatpadārthānāmahiṃsaivāsti nāsti 
kāya iti śabdena vaktavyaṃ | arhaduktaśāstrajñānena 
caitacchāstroktataptaśilāśayanāditapobhiśca jinānāmahiṃsayā cāsya 
doṣāḥ kṣīyante | evamarhanniva kṣīṇadoṣo bhavati caitāni śāstrāṇi 
santi na veti pṛchyamāne santīti ca na santīti ca nocyanta iti caitattrayaṃ 
vedabāhyā īśvara ityeka anādigatasthairyo na(,) ācāravihīnāśca nāstikā | 
ucyante| 
vaidikaśāstrāṇi ṣaṭ | teṣāmutpattibhūtā ṛgyajuḥsāmātharvaṇā iti 
vedāścatvāraḥ eteṣāmaṃgāni 
chaṃdaḥkalpaśikṣāvyākaraṇaniruktajyotīṃṣīti ṣaṭ maṃtrarūpeṇa 
brāhmaṇarūpeṇa vidhirūpeṇa ca brāhmaṇādivarṇadharmāṇāṃ 
brahmacaryādyāśramadharmāṇāṃ pratipādanaṃ ca upaniṣadbhāgaiḥ 
prakṛtipuruṣeśvarapratipādanaṃ ca vedānāṃ prameyārthāḥ 
vedasiddhācārasya pravartakāni | śaucādeśca vyavahārasya ca prāyaścittasya 
ca niyāmakāni manvādidharmaśāstrāṇyaṣṭādaśa | eteṣāṃ praṇetāro 
manvādayo maharṣayaḥ| 
vāsudevapraṇītapāṃcarātraśāstreṇa tu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ(-) 
sāṃkhyoktacaturviṃśatitattvaguṇatattvoparipaṃcaviṃśatitattvaṃ vāsudeva 
ityākhyāvanna kimapi paratattvaṃ | etasmātparatattvāt 
kṛṣṇāniruddhamakaradhvajarauhiṇeyā iti catvāro vyūhāḥ 
jagatsṛṣṭyarthamutpadyante | etaiścaturbhirjaḍājaḍātmakaṃ vastu samastaṃ 
vyajyata iti ca vedānteṣu pariṇāmavādibhiruktavadetadakhilaṃ vāsudeva iti ca 
| vedeṣu puruṣārthā na santi pāṃcarātreṣu puruṣārthāḥ santi | ataḥ 
pāṃcarātroktakrameṇa dīkṣayitvā vāsudevaṃ samārādhya vāsudevasvarūpe 
layo mokṣa iti ca |

<pṛ0 10> itihāsapurāṇaistu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ(-) vaidikadharmāṇāṃ ca 
sāṃkhyapātaṃjalapratipāditārthānāṃ ca 
pāṃcarātrapāśupataśaivoktārthānāṃ ca sṛṣṭisaṃhārayośca 
vaṃśānāṃ ca manvaṃtarāṇāṃ ca vaṃśānucaritānāṃ ca pratipādanam | 
itihāso mahābhārataṃ purāṇānyaṣṭādaśa | eteṣāṃ kartā vedavyāsaḥ | 
paṃcaviṃśatitattvamātmeti(,) ṣaḍviṃśatitattvaṃ rudra iti(,) 
saptaviṃśatitattvaṃ śiva iti(,) padārthān viditvā dīkṣayā muktā 
bhavantīti purāṇānāṃ prameyārthaḥ | 
pāśupataśāstreṇa tu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ(-) ātmāno bahavo vyāpakā 
nityāḥ kāryakāraṇasaṃyogajātā jñānātparasparaṃ bhinnāśca 
eteṣāmāṇavamalaṃ nāsti māyāmalena karmapāśena ca baddhāḥ 
sāṃsārikasukhaduḥkhānyanubhavanti vairāgyotpattau śāstroktakrameṇa 
dīkṣiteṣvātmasu parameśvarasya jñānaguṇaḥ saṃkrānto bhavati | putreṣu 
kuṭuṃbadhuraṃ nidhāya sanyasanta iva ātmajñānaṃ saṃkramayya īśvaraḥ 
svādhikārāduparato bhavati | 
mahāvratena tu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ(-) pāśupatoktakrameṇaiva 
āṇavakārmyamāyīyātmakamalamuktānāmātmanāṃ saṃsāradaśāyāmapi 
jñānaśaktireva na tu kriyāśaktiḥ śāstroktakrameṇa dīkṣitā 
asthidhāriṇaḥ śāstroktacaryānuṣṭhātāro muktā bhavanti ca | te ca 
muktāḥ kevalaṃ jñānaśaktimanta eva | jñānakriyāśaktidvayaṃ tu 
parameśvarasyaikasyaiveti | 
kāpālena tu pratipādyamāno'rthaḥ(-) 
pāśupatamahāvratoktakrameṇātmalakṣaṇaṃ baṃdhalakṣaṇaṃ cāstīti ca 
śāstroktakrameṇa dīkṣitena dine dine sāmyaikadhvajapatākāvyāptāyāṃ 
diśi manuṣyakapāle bhikṣāmaṭatā bhoktavyamiti ca | mahāvratānāmiva mokṣa 
iti ca pāśupatamahāvratakāpālānāṃ śāstrāṇāṃ vaktāro 
māyātattvavidyātattvavāsinastrayo rudrā 
adṛṣṭaśāstrabhūtasiddhāntaśāstrasya iha loke 
viśvāsajanakaparameśvareṇa tatpuruṣāghoravāmadevasadyojātanāmabhiḥ 
caturbhiradhovaktrairanugṛhīte vijñānakaivalye 
etadetatsaṃjñaiścaturbhirātmabhiruktāni 
gāruḍadakṣiṇavāmabhūtānītyadhaḥsrotāṃsi catvāri śāstrāṇi | 
eteṣāṃ gāruḍataṃtreṇa tatpuruṣaṃ brahmasvarūpavaddhyātvā parameśvaraḥ 
pūjanīya ityucyate | anena śāstreṇa pratyakṣaṃ sarpacikitsārtha 
maṃtrauṣadhāni coktāni | dakṣiṇataṃtreṇa tu aghoraṃ 
brahmasvarūpavaddhyātvā pūjanīyaḥ parameśvara iti ca | yogena parameśvaraḥ 
pratyakṣīkārya iti coktaṃ śatrujayāya maṃtraprayogāśca | vāmataṃtreṇa 
tu vāmadevaṃ brahmasvarūpavaddhyātvā 

<pṛ0 11> pūjanīyaḥ parameśvara iti strīvaśyārthaṃ maṃtrataṃtrauṣadhāni 
coktāni | bhūtataṃtreṇa tu sadyojātaṃ brahmasvarūpavaddhyātvā 
parameśvaraḥ pūjanīya ityuktaṃ bhūtapretapiśācacikitsārthaṃ 
maṃtrauṣadhāni ca śaktitattvavāsinā kena cidātmanā śāktataṃtramuktam | 
bhāskarīyavedāntavādiproktavajjaḍājaḍamakhilaṃ 
śaktipariṇatirityetattaṃtrasya mataṃ tānyadhaḥsrotāṃsi catvāri ca 
sākṣācchivapraṇītāni bhavanti | kau(?)ādiśāstrāṇi 
manuṣyairmaccheṃdranāthādisiddhairuktāni | lokāyitajñānināṃ 
pṛthivyaptejovāyūnāṃ caturṇāṃ bhūtānāṃ jñānena tattattvodbhūtaṃ 
janma viramati | bauddhānāṃ buddhitattvādarvākprapaṃcajananaṃ viramati | 
ārhatānāṃ guṇatattvādarvāktattvajanma viramati 
nyāyavaiśeṣikayorbuddhitattvāntasaṃsārasāro viramati | sāṃkhyānāṃ 
prakṛtipuruṣayorvivekajñāne satyapi prakṛterupari 
miśrādhvaviṣayatattvajñānāsaṃbhavādaśeṣakarmanāśānutpattervijñānakai
valyaṃ nāsti pāṃcarātrāṇāṃ prakṛterarvāksaṃsāro viramati | 
vedāntināṃ puruṣatattvaprāptiḥ syāt paurāṇikānāṃ rāgatattvaprāptiḥ 
syāt | kāpālikānāṃ kālatattvaprāptiḥ syāt| pāśupatānāṃ 
māyātattvaprāptiḥ syāt | mahāvratānāṃ        vidyātattvaprāptiḥ syāt | 
śrotontaragāruḍadakṣiṇavāmabhūtataṃtreṣu dīkṣitānāṃ 
śaktitattvasthitanivṛttipratiṣṭhāvidyāśāṃtibhuvanaprāptiḥ syāt | 
śuddhaśāktānāṃ śaktitattvaprāptiḥ syāt | kaulayāma(?)ādiśāstrāṇāṃ 
hiṃsāmaithunasaṃgasya saṃbhavāt piśācapadaprāptiḥ syāt |

siddhāntaśāstraṃ tu śivabhedarudrabhedatvena dvividham 

biṃduśakternādabiṃdupraṇavātmakāyāḥ pariṇateranaṃtaraṃ 
mātṛkājanyānuṣṭupchaṃdonibaddhapraṇavādīnāṃ 
māyordhvavijñānakevalākhyānāṃ parameśvareṇānugṛhītānāṃ 
daśaśivānāṃ kāmikādisaṃjñayā 
śabdārthātmakasadyojātavāmadevamukhābhyāṃ proktāni śivabhedāhvayāni 
śāstrāṇi daśa |
evaṃ 
parameśvareṇopadiṣṭajñānānāmaṣṭādaśarudrāṇāmaghoratatpuruṣeśānava
danairvijayādisaṃjñayā proktāni rudrabhedāhvayānītyaṣṭādaśa 
śāstrāṇi | 
evamaṣṭāviṃśatiśāstrāṇāmekaikasyaikakoṭisaṃkhyayā'ṣṭāviṃśatikoṭi
granthāḥ eteṣāmaṣṭāviṃśatiśāstrāṇāṃ siddhānta iti nāma etāni 
pratyekaṃ jñānakriyāyogacaryābhiścatuṣpādāni |

<pṛ0 12> eteṣāṃ jñānapādena tu(-)parameśvarasvarūpaṃ ca 
vijñānākalapralayākalasakalānāmātmanāṃ svarūpaṃ ca 
āṇavakārmyamāyīyabaiṃdavarodhaśaktyātmakapāśasvarūpaṃ ca śaktirūpaṃ 
ca śivatattvamārabhya pṛthivītattvāṃtaṣaṭtriṃśattattvānāṃ 
sṛṣṭiprakāraśca etairātmanāṃ bhogasādhanairbhavitavyaṃ ca bhuvanānāṃ 
bhuvaneśvarāṇāṃ svarūpaṃ ca parameśvaramārabhya bhuvanānāṃ 
yojanānyetāvaṃtīti ca parimāṇāni ca 
adhaḥpralayamadhyapralayamahāpralayānāṃ svarūpaṃ ca 
tattatpralayānaṃtarasṛṣṭiprakāraśca 
pāśupatamahāvratakāpālaśāstravaktṛkathanaṃ ca tattacchāstroktārthaṃ 
pūrvapakṣīkṛtya prameyaniyamaśca procyante | 
kriyāpādena tu(-) maṃtroddhārasaṃdhyāvaṃdanapūjājapahomāśca 
samayaviśeṣanirvāṇasaṃskārāścācāryābhiṣekaśca 
sādhakābhiṣekaścātmanāṃ bhogamokṣopāyabhūtadīkṣā ca procyante |
yogapādena tu(-) etāni ṣaṭtriṃśattattvāni ca tattveśvarāśca 
bhuvaneśvarāśca ātmā ca parameśvaraśca śaktiśca 
jagatkāraṇabhūtamāyāmahāmāyayoḥ pratyakṣībhāvaśca | 
aihikatattvasiddhyapekṣiṇāmaṇimādisaṃbhavaśca 
prāṇāyāmapratyāhāradhyānadhāraṇasamādhiprakāraśca 
mūlādhārādyādhārāṇāmavasthānaṃ ca procyante | 
caryāpādena tu(-) prāyaścittaṃ pavitrāropaṇaṃ pratiṣṭhāśca 
śivaliṃgalakṣaṇaṃ ca umāmaheśvarādivyaktaliṃgalakṣaṇaṃ ca 
skaṃdanaṃdyādigaṇeśvaralakṣaṇaṃ ca japamālālakṣaṇaṃ ca 
antyeṣṭiśrāddhāni ca procyante samayasaṃskāreṇa rudrapadaprāptiḥ syāt | 
viśeṣasaṃskāreṇeśvarapadaprāptiḥ syāt | prakṛtitattvādupari 
miśrādhvani prathamatattvabhūtarāgatattvaprāptireveśvarapadaprāptiḥ | iyaṃ 
sāṃkhyapātaṃjalavedāntapāṃcarātroktamokṣādupari nirvāṇadīkṣayā 
parameśvarasāmyarūpamokṣaṃ prāpayati sā ca 
sadyonirvāṇāsadyonirvāṇatvena dvividhā sadyonirvāṇadīkṣayā 
kriyāsamanaṃtarakāla eva śarīraṃ vihāya mokṣaṃ prāpnuvanti | 
asadyonirvāṇadīkṣā dīkṣākāle bhūtāni bhaviṣyanti ca karmāṇi 
saṃśodhya tadānīṃ saṃbhujyamānasya śarīrahetubhūtasya 
vartamānakarmaṇaḥ śuddhīkaraṇādāyuḥkṣaye śarīratyāgena mokṣaṃ 
prāpayati |
sādhakadīkṣā tu(-) śivabhaktiśivaliṃgārcanayoḥ satorapi 
paścādvidyeśvarādipadābhilāṣiṇastattatpadaṃ prāpayati 
tattatpadaprāptāste ca

<pṛ0 13> yadi madhye viraktāstadānīmeva muktā bhavanti nocenmahāsaṃhārakāle 
muktā bhavanti |
nirbījadīkṣā tu(-) dīkṣottarakāle anuṣṭheyānāṃ 
saṃdhyāvaṃdanaśivaliṃgārcanādīnāṃ dīkṣākāla evācāryeṇa 
saṃśodhyānuṣṭhitatvāt strībālavṛddhavyādhitarājñāṃ vidheyā |
sabījadīkṣā tu(-) samarthānāṃ putrāṇāmācāryairvidheyā | dīkṣayā 
bhūtabhaviṣyadrūpāṇi dvividhāni karmāṇi ca 
etatparipākaprāptānyaśeṣaśarīrāṇi ca śarīrabhogāśca naśyanti | 
śarīrakāraṇabhūtānāṃ karmaṇāṃ śuddhīkaraṇāccharīrāṇi 
sukhaduḥkhānyanubhavitavyānyeva | itthaṃ trividhakarma vinaśyati | sa tu 
dīkṣāyā upari maraṇāntamucyamānaśāstrīyaniyamā 
vartamānaśarīrakāraṇabhūtakarmaṇaḥ sahakārimalaśuddhyai jñānāni 
yogāśca tapāṃsi ca buddhyādisādhanaiḥ sādhyānītyuktatvādebhirna mokṣaḥ 
| kiṃtu parameśvaraprasādātmikayā dīkṣayaiva mokṣa itarairnāsti | 
dīkṣottarakāle ācāryavaikalye buddhipūrvakasya doṣasya prāyaścittena 
śuddhiḥ syāt | maṃtradravyalopādeśca pavitrāropaṇena śuddhiḥ | 
abuddhipūrvakasya niyamalopasyānteṣṭyā śuddhiḥ | 
dīkṣottarakāle'vaśyānuṣṭheyāni karmāṇi yamaniyamasaṃpattiḥ 
śaivasaṃdhyāvaṃdanaṃ śivaliṃgārcanaṃ śivāgnikāryaṃ guruvacanapālanaṃ 
yathāśakti māheśvarapūjā ca |
ananuṣṭheyāni karmāṇi tu(-) anyadaivanirmālyabhakṣaṇaṃ śivaniṃdā ca 
śivabhaktaniṃdā śivaśāstraniṃdā ca śivaśāstraprāptācāraniṃdā ca 
devadravyopabhogaśca bhūtahiṃsā ca evaṃ dīkṣitasyoktānuṣṭhānavato 
muktasyātmano lakṣaṇaṃ 
āṇavakārmyamāyīyabaiṃdavarodhaśaktyākhyapāśapaṃcakādvimuktaśca 
parameśvaravatsarvajñatā nityatṛptatā'nādisiddhabodhatā svataṃtratā 
aluptaśaktitā'naṃtaśaktimattāca evaṃ vidhānāmapyātmanāṃ 
parameśvaravatsṛṣṭyādikartṛtvaṃ nāsti viṣayānaṃdasadbhāvaśca 
rāgadveṣādīnāṃ vidyamānatā ca sṛṣṭyāderakartṛtāyāḥ kāraṇaṃ 
paṃcavidhakṛtyena tu parameśvara eva parānugrahaṃ karoti | [iti 
sarvamatotkṛṣṭā śaivasiddhāntadīpikā] | [sarvārthaśaṃbhudevena kalpitā 
śaivasaṃmatā] ||
[śaivasiddhāntadīpikānāma pāśupatamataprakaraṇaṃ samāptam] |







